uvm_field_utils_begin(T)

* 使用 field macros用在utility mcros中，用来将变量(field)在工厂中注册，以指定参与到类的方法的执行的变量，这叫做 field_automation，也就是将这些field像类一样在factory中注册

  <img width="550" alt="image" src="https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/assets/66343787/c5709ebd-bf1f-4720-a8be-ac1c632bbace">

* 定义了一个`__m_uvm_field_automation`函数的开头，函数的具体内容由后面的field automation macros来定义
* 这其实是重载 [uvm_object:m_uvm_field_automation](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/edit/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2019%3A%20uvm_object.md)

* 第一个参数表示当涉及到第二个对象的 field_objection 时，这个对象的指针，第二个参数表示 field_automation 的类型，第三个参数仅用于 set_*_local 系列函数，表明要设置的变量的名字。

  <img width="950" alt="image" src="https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/assets/66343787/6b6feaff-be7c-4644-bd26-ee4cf3e49294">

* 函数会首先检查 tmp_data__ 即输入的参数是否为 null，如果不为 null，会看一下输入的这个指针是不是 T 类型的，因为只有相同类同的类才能继续操作，这里的检查是通过类型转换完成的，因此如果成功，则 ***local_data__ 中就保存了传入的 tmp_data__ 中的所有属性，之后的操作都是通过 local_data__ 来进行，一般情况下，比如 copy 等函数，这个参数就是被 copy 的 source object***

* `__m_uvm_status_container` 是定义在 [uvm_object](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2019%3A%20uvm_object.md) 中的一个 [uvm_status_container](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2021%3A%20uvm_misc.md) 类型的变量，其中包含 packer, recorder, printer, scope 等变量，对这些变量的赋值分别在 uvm_object 中的每一种函数中执行。


* uvm_object tmp_data__:
  - Represents a temporary object used as source/target for operations like copy, compare, pack/unpack
  - Typically the object being operated on or compared against

* int what__:
  - Indicates the type of operation being performed
  - Usually an enumerated value representing operations such as:
    - UVM_COPY: Copying fields from one object to another
    - UVM_COMPARE: Comparing fields between two objects  
    - UVM_PACK: Packing fields into a bitstream
    - UVM_UNPACK: Unpacking fields from a bitstream
    - UVM_PRINT: Printing field values
    - UVM_SETINT: Setting integer fields
    - UVM_SETOBJ: Setting object fields
    - And others...

* string str__:
  - Used for operations involving string matching or setting fields by name
  - Can represent:
    - A field name or hierarchical path for set/get operations
    - A wildcard pattern for matching multiple fields
    - Additional string information relevant to the specific operation


```systemverilog
`define uvm_field_utils_begin(T) \
  // Define __m_uvm_field_automation function for field automation
  function void __m_uvm_field_automation(uvm_object tmp_data__,
                                         int what__,
                                         string str__);
  begin
    T local_data__; // Local variable for copy and compare operations
    typedef T ___local_type____; // Typedef for the class type
    string string_aa_key; // Key for associative array operations
    uvm_object __current_scopes[$]; // Queue to track object scopes

    // Check for set operations and perform cycle checking
    // The cycle check in UVM is designed to prevent infinite recursion when setting fields in objects that have circular references. 
    // This is particularly important in complex data structures where objects might reference each other.
    if (what__ inside {UVM_SETINT, UVM_SETSTR, UVM_SETOBJ}) begin
      if (__m_uvm_status_container.m_do_cycle_check(this)) begin
        // If no cycle is detected, it updates the current scopes with the cycle scopes from the status container.
        return; // Exit if cycle detected
      end
      else
        __current_scopes = __m_uvm_status_container.m_uvm_cycle_scopes;
    end

    // Call superclass field automation
    super.__m_uvm_field_automation(tmp_data__, what__, str__);

    // Perform type checking and casting
    if (tmp_data__ != null)
      // Allow objects in same hierarchy to be copied/compared
      if (!$cast(local_data__, tmp_data__)) return;
```

```systemverilog
  // ============================================================================= //
  // cycle example                                                                 //
  // ============================================================================= //
  // class ClassA extends uvm_object;                                              //
  //   `uvm_object_utils(ClassA)                                                   //
  //                                                                               //
  //   ClassB b;                                                                   //
  //                                                                               //
  //   function new(string name = "ClassA");                                       //
  //     super.new(name);                                                          //
  //   endfunction                                                                 //
  //                                                                               //
  //   `uvm_object_utils_begin(ClassA)                                             //
  //     `uvm_field_object(b, UVM_DEFAULT)                                         //
  //   `uvm_object_utils_end                                                       //
  // endclass                                                                      //
  //                                                                               //
