run_test

* 使用单例模式，调用[uvm_coreservice:get_root](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2018%3A%20uvm_coreservice.md#get_root) 来创建一个 uvm_root 的实例，这个实例携带了domain，domain中包含所有的 phase

  <img width="1000" alt="image" src="https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/assets/66343787/29e85b0a-9f04-49ea-b23d-31254b71027d">


* 调用[uvm_root:run_test](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2008%3A%20uvm_root.md#run_test)


```systemverilog
task run_test (string test_name="");
  uvm_root top;
  uvm_coreservice_t cs;

  // Get the singleton instance of the UVM core service
  cs = uvm_coreservice_t::get();

  // Get the root component from the core service
  top = cs.get_root();

  // Call the run_test method on the root component
  // This initiates the UVM test execution
  top.run_test(test_name);
endtask
```

