set_global_timeout

* 调用[uvm_root:set_timeout](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2008%3A%20uvm_root.md)，这里提供了一个为 uvm_phase 设置 timeout的接口，在 [uvm_phase:execute_phase](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2007%3A%20uvm_phase.md#execute_phase) 中如果 runtime_phase 超过了 timeout 等待时间会报错

```systemverilog
function void set_global_timeout(time timeout, bit overridable = 1);
  uvm_root top;
  uvm_coreservice_t cs;
  cs = uvm_coreservice_t::get();
  top = cs.get_root();
  top.set_timeout(timeout,overridable);
endfunction
```

