uvm_wait_for_nba_region

* this task will not return until the NBA region, thus allowing other processes any number of delta cycles (#0) to settle out before continuing.
* 在 [uvm_sequencer_base:wait_for_sequences](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/ee2fec3ec52b644261be7aa7853ea756bc445af1/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2003%3A%20uvm_sequencer_base.md) 中使用

```systemverilog
task uvm_wait_for_nba_region;

  string s;

  int nba;
  int next_nba;

  //If `included directly in a program block, can't use a non-blocking assign,
  //but it isn't needed since program blocks are in a separate region.
`ifndef UVM_NO_WAIT_FOR_NBA
  next_nba++;
  nba <= next_nba;
  @(nba);
`else
  repeat(`UVM_POUND_ZERO_COUNT) #0;
`endif

endtask
```

