uvm_split_string

```systemverilog
function automatic void uvm_split_string (string str, byte sep, ref string values[$]);
  int s = 0, e = 0;
  values.delete();
  while(e < str.len()) begin
    for(s=e; e<str.len(); ++e)
      if(str[e] == sep) break;
    if(s != e)
      values.push_back(str.substr(s,e-1));
    e++;
  end
endfunction
```

