create

* 获取工厂，调用工厂的[factory:create_object_by_type](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2003%3A%20uvm_factory.md)函数，传入父类的全名和当前类的全名，最后得到先要创建的对象，但是这是一个 uvm_object 通常情况下没有 parent，如果有，唯一的作用也只是改变路径，并不会将当前 object 添加到树结构中

  ```systemverilog
  gb_ins = global_blk::type_id::create("gb_ins", , get_full_name());
  ```

* 这里的name会被当作路径来查找是否有instance override 
* 通过cast函数检查两者之间的继承关系，只有存在继承关系的类之间才可以override，如果类存在参数，只有参数值相同的两个类才存在继承关系。

```systemverilog
  static function T create (string name="", uvm_component parent=null,
                            string contxt="");
    uvm_object obj;
    uvm_coreservice_t cs = uvm_coreservice_t::get();                                                     
    uvm_factory factory=cs.get_factory();

    if (contxt == "" && parent != null)
      contxt = parent.get_full_name();

    obj = factory.create_object_by_type(get(),contxt,name);
    if (!$cast(create, obj)) begin
      string msg;
      msg = {"Factory did not return an object of type '",type_name,
        "'. A component of type '",obj == null ? "null" : obj.get_type_name(),
        "' was returned instead. Name=",name," Parent=",
        parent==null?"null":parent.get_type_name()," contxt=",contxt};
      uvm_report_fatal("FCTTYP", msg, UVM_NONE);
    end
  endfunction
```

