set_inst_override

* 获取工厂，调用工厂的[factory:set_inst_override_by_type](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2003%3A%20uvm_factory.md)
* 这里的需要传入inst_path 和 parent，虽然 object 没有 parent，但是这里可以随意传入，因为只用作路径的修改，通过两个路径最后拼接成一个完整的路径
* 想要成功设置路径，需要保证这里的路径和 [factory:create_object_by_type](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2003%3A%20uvm_factory.md) 中相同

```systemverilog
  static function void set_inst_override(uvm_object_wrapper override_type,
                                         string inst_path,
                                         uvm_component parent=null);
    string full_inst_path;
    uvm_coreservice_t cs = uvm_coreservice_t::get();                                                     
    uvm_factory factory=cs.get_factory();

    if (parent != null) begin
      if (inst_path == "")
        inst_path = parent.get_full_name();
      else
        inst_path = {parent.get_full_name(),".",inst_path};
    end
    factory.set_inst_override_by_type(get(),override_type,inst_path);
  endfunction

endclass
```

