set_type_override_by_name

* 被[component:set_type_override](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2006%3A%20uvm_component.md)调用

* 先检查是否两个名字已经被注册，如果已经注册那么获得对应的代理对象
* 遍历所有已经override的类，查找当前类是否已经被重写。如果找到，则对原有信息进行更新，如果没有则插入一条新的override的记录
  * 判断的依据是：如果名字相同则相同(因为这个函数是 override by name)
* 这里传入的名字通常情况和注册时候使用的名字不同，因此很难直接查找到，通常都是添加一条新的记录。

* **通常的情况下，type 存储的是代理对象，type name 是以字符串形式存储的类的名字**

* 默认情况下，如果对同一个类型进行多次 override，后面执行的语句会将前面的信息覆盖掉

```systemverilog
protected uvm_factory_override m_type_overrides[$];
```
* 这个队列中存储的是 [uvm_factory_override](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03:%20uvm_base/chapter%2004:%20uvm_factory_override.md) 类型的变量

```systemverilog
function void uvm_default_factory::set_type_override_by_name (string original_type_name,
                                                      string override_type_name,
                                                      bit replace=1);
  bit replaced;

  uvm_object_wrapper original_type;
  uvm_object_wrapper override_type;

  // Try to get the original type wrapper from the type names map
  if(m_type_names.exists(original_type_name))
    original_type = m_type_names[original_type_name];

  // Try to get the override type wrapper from the type names map
  if(m_type_names.exists(override_type_name))
    override_type = m_type_names[override_type_name];

  // Check if the override type is registered with the factory
  if (override_type == null) begin
      uvm_report_error("TYPNTF", {"Cannot register override for original type '",
      original_type_name,"' because the override type '",
      override_type_name, "' is not registered with the factory."}, UVM_NONE);
    return;
  end

  // Check if the original and override type names are the same
  if (original_type_name == override_type_name) begin
      uvm_report_warning("TYPDUP", {"Requested and actual type name ",
      " arguments are identical: ",original_type_name,". Ignoring this override."}, UVM_NONE);
    return;
  end

  // Iterate through existing type overrides
  foreach (m_type_overrides[index]) begin
    if (m_type_overrides[index].orig_type_name == original_type_name) begin
      // If replace is not set, report that the override already exists
      if (!replace) begin
        uvm_report_info("TPREGD", {"Original type '",original_type_name,
          "' already registered to produce '",m_type_overrides[index].ovrd_type_name,
          "'.  Set 'replace' argument to replace the existing entry."}, UVM_MEDIUM);
        return;
      end
      // If replace is set, update the existing override
      uvm_report_info("TPREGR", {"Original object type '",original_type_name,
        "' already registered to produce '",m_type_overrides[index].ovrd_type_name,
        "'.  Replacing with override to produce type '",override_type_name,"'."}, UVM_MEDIUM);
      replaced = 1;
      m_type_overrides[index].ovrd_type = override_type; 
      m_type_overrides[index].ovrd_type_name = override_type_name; 
    end
  end

  // If the original type is not registered, add it to the lookup strings
  if (original_type == null)
    m_lookup_strs[original_type_name] = 1;

  // If no existing override was replaced, create a new override
  if (!replaced) begin
    uvm_factory_override override;
    override = new(.orig_type(original_type),
                   .orig_type_name(original_type_name),
                   .full_inst_path("*"),
                   .ovrd_type(override_type));

    m_type_overrides.push_back(override);
  end

endfunction
```


