```systemverilog
class uvm_factory_queue_class;
  uvm_factory_override queue[$];
endclass
```
```systemverilog
protected uvm_factory_queue_class m_inst_override_queues[uvm_object_wrapper];
```
* 存放所有通过实例override的信息 -> key: 代理对象 value: override信息队列（原始类型override路径，新类型）
* 可以支持对同一个类型的不同实例定义不同override规则，因此这个需要使用队列对数据进行保存

* 用于重写某一路径(instance_name.instance_name...)上的具体的一个type, 这里传入的路径 full_inst_path 由两部分组成，一部分是从 uvm_test_done 到当前 component 之间，一部分是从当前 component 到目标 component/object 之间

```systemverilog
function void uvm_default_factory::set_inst_override_by_type (uvm_object_wrapper original_type,
                                                      uvm_object_wrapper override_type,
                                                      string full_inst_path);

  uvm_factory_override override;

  // Register the original and override types if they're not already registered
  if (!m_types.exists(original_type))
    register(original_type); 

  if (!m_types.exists(override_type))
    register(override_type); 

  // Check if this override already exists, if so, return without adding a duplicate
  if (check_inst_override_exists(original_type,override_type,full_inst_path))
    return;

  // Create a new queue for this original type if it doesn't exist yet
  if(!m_inst_override_queues.exists(original_type))
    m_inst_override_queues[original_type] = new;

  // Create a new override object with the provided information
  override = new(.full_inst_path(full_inst_path),
                 .orig_type(original_type),
                 .orig_type_name(original_type.get_type_name()),
                 .ovrd_type(override_type));

  // Add the new override to the queue for this original type
  m_inst_override_queues[original_type].queue.push_back(override);

endfunction
```

