create_object_by_name

* 用于直接获取工厂，并调用这个函数创建实例。只能应用于不含参数的类的实例化。
* `requested_type_name`: 用来判断当前类是否已经被注册，class name的字符串形式
* `parent_inst_path`: 用来判断时候当前类已经被其他类重写，parent instance path，用来构成当前instance path
* `name`: 当前instance name

* 调用`uvm_object_wrapper`的`create_object`方法，这里使用多态，父类引用`uvm_object_wrapper`指向子类对象`uvm_object_registry`，因此实际上调用的是代理对象的方法。[uvm_object_registry:create_object](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03:%20uvm_base/chapter%2002:%20uvm_object_registry.md)

* 通过这种这种方法创建实例，只是在工厂内进行检查，如果存在就用工厂中注册的代理创建一个新的对象，因此工厂返回的是唯一的代理对象，代理对象可以创建多次实例并返回，实例本身并不是唯一的。

* **所有的包含参数的类，都无法使用 create_object_by_name 创建，甚至无法使用 *_by_name 方法，因为这种类不会在m_type_names中注册**
```systemverilog
function uvm_object uvm_default_factory::create_object_by_name (string requested_type_name,  
                                                        string parent_inst_path="",  
                                                        string name=""); 

  // Declare variables to hold the object wrapper and instance path
  uvm_object_wrapper wrapper;
  string inst_path;

  // Construct the full instance path based on parent_inst_path and name
  if (parent_inst_path == "")
    inst_path = name;
  else if (name != "")
    inst_path = {parent_inst_path,".",name};
  else
    inst_path = parent_inst_path;

  // Clear any previous override information
  m_override_info.delete();

  // Check for any overrides for the requested type
  wrapper = find_override_by_name(requested_type_name, inst_path);

  // If no override exists, try to use the requested type directly
  if (wrapper==null) begin
    // Check if the requested type is registered with the factory
    if(!m_type_names.exists(requested_type_name)) begin
      // Report a warning if the type is not registered
      uvm_report_warning("BDTYP",{"Cannot create an object of type '",
      requested_type_name,"' because it is not registered with the factory."}, UVM_NONE);
      return null;
    end
    // Get the wrapper for the requested type from the factory
    wrapper = m_type_names[requested_type_name];
  end

  // Create and return the object using the wrapper
  return wrapper.create_object(name);

endfunction

```

