* 这个函数会返回一个T类型的实例句柄，而T就是type_id对应的class类型
* 调用 [uvm_factory:create_object_by_type]() 实例化一个对象，得到对象之后要先转型，来检查如果有 override，返回出来的 override 对象是否和当前想要创建的对象有继承关系

```systemverilog
// Static function to create a component of type T
static function T create(string name, uvm_component parent, string contxt="");
  uvm_object obj;
  uvm_coreservice_t cs;
  uvm_factory factory;

  // Get the core service and factory instances
  cs = uvm_coreservice_t::get();
  factory = cs.get_factory();

  // If context is not provided and parent exists, use parent's full name as context
  if (contxt == "" && parent != null)
    contxt = parent.get_full_name();

  // Create component using factory
  obj = factory.create_component_by_type(
    get(),    // requested_type: The registry for the component type and make sure it is registered with the factory
    contxt,   // parent_inst_path: The hierarchical context for the component
    name,     // name: The name of the component instance
    parent    // parent: The parent component of this instance
  );

  // Check if the created object is of the correct type
  if (!$cast(create, obj)) begin
    string msg;

    // Construct error message if type mismatch occurs
    msg = {
      "Factory did not return a component of type '", type_name,
      "'. A component of type '", (obj == null ? "null" : obj.get_type_name()),
      "' was returned instead. ",
      "Name=", name,
      " Parent=", (parent == null ? "null" : parent.get_type_name()),
      " contxt=", contxt
    };

    // Report fatal error if type mismatch occurs
    uvm_report_fatal("FCTTYP", msg, UVM_NONE);
  end
endfunction
