* 对于每一个class T, 在声明 `uvm_component_registry #(T,Tname)` 的时候，其中的静态变量me为 `uvm_component_registry #(T,Tname)` 类型的一个句柄，在me初始化的时候都会通过get()函数指向该类在系统中的唯一一个实例，并且将该实例句柄在系统唯一的factory实例中调用 [uvm_factory:register](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2003%3A%20uvm_factory.md)进行注册，

```systemverilog

// =================================================================================================== //
// This is a static member initialization.                                                             //
// In SystemVerilog, static member initializations are executed before the first use of the class.     //
// The initialization calls the get() function.                                                        //
// Given this, here's what actually happens:                                                           //
// =================================================================================================== //        
// When the typedef is created, it doesn't immediately trigger the initialization.                     //
// However, the first time any static member or method of this specialized class is accessed           //
// (including when get_type() is called), SystemVerilog will execute all static initializations        //
// for the class.                                                                                      //
// =================================================================================================== //
// At this point, get() is indeed called as part of initializing me.                                   //
// While the get() function isn't executed immediately when                                            //
// the typedef is declared, it is executed as soon as the class is first used in any way, which        //
// effectively means it happens very early in the process, typically during elaboration.               //
// This approach ensures that:                                                                         //
// 1. The singleton instance me is created early.                                                      //
// 2. The type is registered with the factory as soon as the class is first referenced.                //
// 3. Subsequent calls to get() will return this pre-initialized instance.                             //
// =================================================================================================== //

// Static instance of this registry type
local static this_type me = get();

// Static function to get or create the singleton instance of this registry
static function this_type get();
  // If the instance doesn't exist yet, create it
  if (me == null) begin
    uvm_coreservice_t cs = uvm_coreservice_t::get();                                                 
    uvm_factory factory = cs.get_factory();
    me = new;
    // Register this type with the factory
    factory.register(me);
  end
  // Return the singleton instance
  return me;
endfunction
