m_extract_name

* 对传入的路径进行解析，找到实例的名字和其余部分
```systemverilog
function void uvm_component::m_extract_name(input string name ,
                                            output string leaf ,
                                            output string remainder );
  int i , len;
  string extract_str;
  len = name.len();

  for( i = 0; i < name.len(); i++ ) begin  
    if( name[i] == "." ) begin
      break;
    end
  end

  if( i == len ) begin
    leaf = name;
    remainder = "";
    return;
  end

  leaf = name.substr( 0 , i - 1 );
  remainder = name.substr( i + 1 , len - 1 );

  return;
endfunction
```



