apply_config_settings

* 调用 [uvm_object_defines:__m_uvm_field_automation](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/02%3A%20uvm_macros/chapter%2002%3A%20uvm_object_defines.md) 继而调用了 [uvm_status_container:do_field_check](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2021%3A%20uvm_misc.md) 将所有在当前 class 中使用了 field automation 的变量名放入 field_array 中

* 所有通过 [uvm_resource_pool:lookup_scope](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03:%20uvm_base/chapter%2027:%20uvm_resource_pool.md) 获取到 scope 对应的所有 resource 记录，把这些记录排序。这种排序是按照层次结构来排序的，高层的放在最顶端，而底层设置放在底端。优先级的设置顺序在 [uvm_config_db:set](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2032%3A%20uvm_config_db.md) 中声明
  * 若在同一个component中调用uvm_config_db#(T)::set()对同一目标component多次设置同一笔资源，则后设置的有高优先级，因为每次设置都会默认将其存放到队首
  * 若在不同component中调用uvm_config_db#(T)::set()对同一目标component多次设置同一笔资源，根据设置的时间不同，结果不同
    * 在 build_phase 设置:
      * 若set()函数是在build_phase()中被调用，则设置该笔资源的precedence为default_precedence减去cntxt的get_depth()返回值，这就是说，调用set()的component离uvm_top越远，其precedence越小，换句话说，处于UVM平台hireachy顶端的component设置的同样的资源具有较高优先级

    * 在其他 phase 设置
      * 不同的 component 中设置都是使用的默认优先级，因为每次都是插入到队首，因此后加入到相对位置靠前，有更高的优先级

  * 在查找的时候，遍历队列中每一个元素，之后得到了更高优先级的元素才会更新最终结果，因此如果优先级相同的情况下，在队列前面位置比后面位置的优先级更高
    * 最终顺序:  build_phase 顶层加入 > build_phase 底层加入(precedence 更高) / non_build_phase 后加入 > non_build_phase 先加入(在队列中的位置更靠前) / precedence 更高 > 在队列中的位置更靠前


* 如假设在 base_test 中和 env 中同时对此 component 的某个字段进行了设置，由于 env 是在 base_test 中实例化的，其层次低于 base_test，所以 base_test 中的那条 set 记录将会放在最顶端，而 env 中的则放在这条记录的后面。

* **config 机制的原则就是高层的优先级高于低层的优先级，所以从最底层记录开始遍历，并进行设置。如果有高层的记录，那么将会把底层的记录覆盖。**

* 依次遍历每一个条筛选出来的记录，如果和 field automation 中某个变量名一致，则尝试将值赋给它

```systemverilog
function void uvm_component::apply_config_settings (bit verbose=0);

  // Get the global resource pool
  uvm_resource_pool rp = uvm_resource_pool::get();
  // Queue to store resources
  uvm_queue#(uvm_resource_base) rq;
  // Resource base object
  uvm_resource_base r;
  // Strings for resource names
  string name;
  string search_name;
  // Loop counters
  int unsigned i;
  int unsigned j;

  // Check for registered fields using field automation
  __m_uvm_field_automation (null, UVM_CHECK_FIELDS, "");

  // If no fields are declared, exit the function
  if (__m_uvm_status_container.field_array.size() == 0)
    return;

  // Print info message if verbose mode is on
  if(verbose)
    uvm_report_info("CFGAPL","applying configuration settings", UVM_NONE);

  // Lookup resources in the current scope
  rq = rp.lookup_scope(get_full_name());
  // Sort resources by precedence
  rp.sort_by_precedence(rq);

  // Iterate through resources in reverse order (highest precedence first)
  for(int i=rq.size()-1; i>=0; --i) begin

    r = rq.get(i);
    name = r.get_name();

    // Check if name contains brackets [] or dot .
    for(j = 0; j < name.len(); j++)
      if(name[j] == "[" || name[j] == ".")
        break;

    // If brackets/dot found, use substring up to that point for searching
    if(j < name.len())
      search_name = name.substr(0, j-1);
    else
      search_name = name;

    // Skip if field doesn't exist in field_array (except for recording_detail)
    if(!__m_uvm_status_container.field_array.exists(search_name) && 
       search_name != "recording_detail")
      continue;

    // Print info message if verbose mode is on
    if(verbose)
      uvm_report_info("CFGAPL",$sformatf("applying configuration to field %s", name),UVM_NONE);

    begin
       // Try to cast resource to various types and set the field accordingly
       uvm_resource#(uvm_integral_t) rit;
       if ($cast(rit, r))
         set_int_local(name, rit.read(this));
       else begin
          uvm_resource#(uvm_bitstream_t) rbs;
          if($cast(rbs, r))
            set_int_local(name, rbs.read(this));
          else begin
             uvm_resource#(int) ri;
             if($cast(ri, r))
               set_int_local(name, ri.read(this));
             else begin
                uvm_resource#(int unsigned) riu;
                if($cast(riu, r))
                  set_int_local(name, riu.read(this));
                else begin
                   uvm_resource#(uvm_active_passive_enum) rap;
                   if ($cast(rap, r))
                     set_int_local(name, rap.read(this));
                   else begin
                      uvm_resource#(string) rs;
                      if($cast(rs, r))
                        set_string_local(name, rs.read(this));
                      else begin
                         uvm_resource#(uvm_config_object_wrapper) rcow;
                         if ($cast(rcow, r)) begin
                         uvm_config_object_wrapper cow = rcow.read();
                            set_object_local(name, cow.obj, cow.clone);
                         end
                         else begin
                            uvm_resource#(uvm_object) ro;
                            if($cast(ro, r)) begin
                               set_object_local(name, ro.read(this), 0);
                            end 
                            else if (verbose) begin
                               // Print warning if field type is unsupported
                               uvm_report_info("CFGAPL", $sformatf("field %s has an unsupported type", name), UVM_NONE);
                            end
                         end // else: !if($cast(rcow, r))
                      end // else: !if($cast(rs, r))
                   end // else: !if($cast(rap, r))

