define_domain

* 被[set_domain](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2007%3A%20uvm_phase.md#add) 调用
* 查找是否有一个名为 uvm_sched 的结点，这个 domain 是我们刚刚实例化的，它里面是空的，所以这里 schedule 的值为 null
* 实例化一个 UVM_PHASE_SCHEDULE 型的结点，之后调用 [uvm_domain:add_uvm_phases](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2009%3A%20uvm_domain.md#add_uvm_phases) 函数，将动态 phase 添加到 schedule 中 (run time phase => schedular phase => domain phase => common domain)

* 使用[uvm_phase:add]() 把这个新的 domain 加入到 m_common_domain 中，与 run_phase 并行执行。

```systemverilog
function void uvm_component::define_domain(uvm_domain domain);
  uvm_phase schedule;
  //schedule = domain.find(uvm_domain::get_uvm_schedule());
  schedule = domain.find_by_name("uvm_sched");
  if (schedule == null) begin
    uvm_domain common;
    schedule = new("uvm_sched", UVM_PHASE_SCHEDULE);
    uvm_domain::add_uvm_phases(schedule);
    domain.add(schedule);
    common = uvm_domain::get_common_domain();
    if (common.find(domain,0) == null)
      common.add(domain,.with_phase(uvm_run_phase::get()));
  end

endfunction
```
