print_config

```systemverilog
// Function: print_config
//
// Prints configuration information for this component and optionally its children.
// 
// Parameters:
//   recurse - If set, recursively prints config for child components
//   audit - If set, prints audit trail for each resource
//
// This function does the following:
// 1. Gets the global resource pool
// 2. Prints visible resources for this component's scope
// 3. If recurse is set, calls print_config recursively on all child components

function void uvm_component::print_config(bit recurse = 0, audit = 0);

  uvm_resource_pool rp = uvm_resource_pool::get();

  uvm_report_info("CFGPRT","visible resources:",UVM_INFO);
  rp.print_resources(rp.lookup_scope(get_full_name()), audit);

  if(recurse) begin
    uvm_component c;
    foreach(m_children[name]) begin
      c = m_children[name];
      c.print_config(recurse, audit);
    end
  end

endfunction
```
