m_find_predecessor

* 被 [find]() / [set_jump_phase]() 调用
* 从当前phase向前不断递归寻找，直到找到传入的phase。这里保存前驱节点和后继节点使用的是一个数组，也就是说，对于当前节点可以有很多前驱节点和后继节点
* 如果当前的phase是一个domain，则直接返回，因为domain的m_predecessors是空的。
```systemverilog
function uvm_phase uvm_phase::m_find_predecessor(uvm_phase phase, bit stay_in_scope=1, uvm_phase orig_phase=null);
  uvm_phase found;

  // Return null if input phase is null
  if (phase == null) begin
    return null ;
  end

  // Return this phase if it matches the input phase or its implementation
  if (phase == m_imp || phase == this)
    return this;

  // Iterate through all predecessors
  foreach (m_predecessors[pred]) begin
    uvm_phase orig;
    // Set orig to this phase if orig_phase is null, otherwise use orig_phase
    orig = (orig_phase==null) ? this : orig_phase;

    // Check if we should search this predecessor
    // only search in the same schedule or domain
    if (!stay_in_scope || 
        (pred.get_schedule() == orig.get_schedule()) ||
        (pred.get_domain() == orig.get_domain())) begin
      // Recursively search for the phase in the predecessor
      found = pred.m_find_predecessor(phase,stay_in_scope,orig);
      // If found, return the result
      if (found != null)
        return found;
    end
  end

  // Return null if not found in any predecessor
  return null;
endfunction
```
