```
* 被[uvm_domain:get_common_domain](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2009%3A%20uvm_domain.md)调用，将一个普通的 function phase 节点加入到一个 uvm_domain 中

* 被[uvm_domain:add_uvm_phases](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2009%3A%20uvm_domain.md)调用，将一个普通的 task phase 节点加入到一个 uvm_schedular 中

* 检查当前输入参数，如果传入了 with_phase / before_phase / after_phase，调用[find]() 函数递归找到该节点

* 参数:
  * 第一个参数是加入的 `phase`

  * 第二个是 `with_phase`，用于表明这个新加入的 `phase` 与原来的 `DOMAIN` 或者 `SCHEDULE` 中的哪个 `phase` 是并行的，当在 `m_uvm_domain` 中加入 `m_uvm_schedule` 时，就用到了这个参数
  * 第三个是 `after_phase`，表明这个新加入的 `phase` 位于原 `DOMAIN` 或者 `SCHEDULE` 中哪个 `phase `的后面
  * 第四个是 `before_phase`，表明这个新加入的 `phase` 位于原 `DOMAIN` 或者 `SCHEDULE` 中哪个 `phase` 的前面。

* case1: `domain.add(uvm_build_phase::get())` `schedule.add(uvm_pre_reset_phase::get())`
  * 如果传入的 `phase` 类型是 `UVM_PHASE_IMP` 代表这是一个单实例的普通 `phase`, 因此创建一个普通节点`UVM_PHASE_NODE`，这个普通节点指向这个`phase`.

  * 如果是动态`phase`, 需要加入`objection`
  * 将当前节点添加到终止节点之前:
    * 名义上:`before_phase = m_end_node`
    * 实际上:
      * 把新结点的 `m_predecessors` 更新为 `m_end_node` 的 `m_predecessors`。
      * 那些以 `m_end_node` 作为 `m_successors` 的结点，把它们的 `m_successors` 更新为新加入的结点。

      * 把 `m_end_node` 的 `m_predecessors` 更新为新插入的结点。

* case2: `m_uvm_domain.add(m_uvm_schedule)`
  * 传入的 `phase` 类型不是 `UVM_PHASE_IMP`，直接使用当前phase对象，不会创建新的节点

* case3: `m_common_domain.add(domain,.with_phase(m_common_domain.find(uvm_run_phase::get())))`
  * 调用[find]()函数确保这个 with_phase 是已经存在在这个 domain 里面的

  * 传入的 `phase` 类型不是 `UVM_PHASE_IMP`，直接使用当前phase对象，不会创建新的节点
  * 更新当前 `phase` 的前驱节点和后继节点的信息

```systemverilog
function void uvm_phase::add(uvm_phase phase,
                             uvm_phase with_phase=null,
                             uvm_phase after_phase=null,
                             uvm_phase before_phase=null);
  uvm_phase new_node, begin_node, end_node, tmp_node;
  uvm_phase_state_change state_chg;

  // Check if the phase argument is null
  if (phase == null)
      `uvm_fatal("PH/NULL", "add: phase argument is null")

  // If with_phase is specified and is a UVM_PHASE_IMP type
  if (with_phase != null && with_phase.get_phase_type() == UVM_PHASE_IMP) begin
    string nm = with_phase.get_name();
    // Find the actual phase node in the current phase hierarchy
    with_phase = find(with_phase);
    if (with_phase == null)
      `uvm_fatal("PH_BAD_ADD",
         {"cannot find with_phase '",nm,"' within node '",get_name(),"'"})
  end

  // If before_phase is specified and is a UVM_PHASE_IMP type
  if (before_phase != null && before_phase.get_phase_type() == UVM_PHASE_IMP) begin
    string nm = before_phase.get_name();
    // Find the actual phase node in the current phase hierarchy
    before_phase = find(before_phase);
    if (before_phase == null)
      `uvm_fatal("PH_BAD_ADD",
         {"cannot find before_phase '",nm,"' within node '",get_name(),"'"})
  end

  // If after_phase is specified and is a UVM_PHASE_IMP type
  if (after_phase != null && after_phase.get_phase_type() == UVM_PHASE_IMP) begin
    string nm = after_phase.get_name();
    // Find the actual phase node in the current phase hierarchy
    after_phase = find(after_phase);
    if (after_phase == null)
      `uvm_fatal("PH_BAD_ADD",
         {"cannot find after_phase '",nm,"' within node '",get_name(),"'"})
  end

  // Check for invalid combination of phase relationships
  if (with_phase != null && (after_phase != null || before_phase != null))
    `uvm_fatal("PH_BAD_ADD",
       "cannot specify both 'with' and 'before/after' phase relationships")

  // Check for invalid phase placements
  if (before_phase == this || after_phase == m_end_node || with_phase == m_end_node)
    `uvm_fatal("PH_BAD_ADD",
       "cannot add before begin node, after end node, or with end nodes")

  // 如果当前是一个普通节点，创建一个 UVM_PHASE_NODE 的对象，将其内部指针指向将要添加到 uvm_phase
  // 根据不同的类型，更新 begin_node 和 end_node 的信息，如果是简单节点那就全部指向其本身，
  // 如果是 uvm_domain 使用当前 domain 的尾巴节点
  if (phase.get_phase_type() == UVM_PHASE_IMP) begin
    uvm_task_phase tp;
    new_node = new(phase.get_name(),UVM_PHASE_NODE,this);
    new_node.m_imp = phase;
    begin_node = new_node;
    end_node = new_node;

    // 创建 objection，绑定给 phase，不同类型的 phase 创建不同类型的 objection，
    // 对于 run_phase 创建的是 uvm_test_done_objection，同时这个 objection 可以通过全局变量 uvm_test_done 访问，
    // 其他 phase 创建的是 uvm_objection
    if ($cast(tp, phase)) begin
       if (new_node.get_name() == "run") begin
         new_node.phase_done = uvm_test_done_objection::get();
       end
       else begin
         new_node.phase_done = uvm_objection::type_id::create({phase.get_name(), "_objection"});
       end
    end

  end
  // if the phase is a uvm_domain or uvm_schedule, then use m_end_node pointer to point to the ending phase
  else begin
    begin_node = phase;
    end_node   = phase.m_end_node;
    phase.m_parent = this;
  end

  // If no before/after/with specified, insert at end of this schedule
  if (with_phase == null && after_phase == null && before_phase == null) begin
    before_phase = m_end_node;
  end

  if (m_phase_trace) begin
    uvm_phase_type typ = phase.get_phase_type();
    `uvm_info("PH/TRC/ADD_PH",
      {get_name()," (",m_phase_type.name(),") ADD_PHASE: phase=",phase.get_full_name()," (",
      typ.name(),", inst_id=",$sformatf("%0d",phase.get_inst_id()),")",
      " with_phase=",   (with_phase == null)   ? "null" : with_phase.get_name(), 
      " after_phase=",  (after_phase == null)  ? "null" : after_phase.get_name(),
      " bef

wait_for_self_and_siblings_to_drop

* 被[execute_phase]() 调用，反复确认当前 phase 已经 drop objection，如果在不同的domain中有同步的phase，确认这些 phase 也 drop objection
* 如果找到了还没有结束的 objection 会将当前 phase 的状态重新更新成 UVM_PHASE_EXECUTING
* This task loops until this phase instance and all its siblings, either sync'd or sharing a common successor, have all objections dropped

```systemverilog
task uvm_phase::wait_for_self_and_siblings_to_drop() ;
  bit need_to_check_all = 1 ;
  uvm_root top;
  uvm_coreservice_t cs;
  bit siblings[uvm_phase];

  cs = uvm_coreservice_t::get();
  top = cs.get_root();

  get_predecessors_for_successors(siblings);
  foreach (m_sync[i]) begin
    siblings[m_sync[i]] = 1;
  end

  while (need_to_check_all) begin
    need_to_check_all = 0 ; //if all are dropped, we won't need to do this again

    // wait for own objections to drop
    if ((phase_done != null) && (phase_done.get_objection_total(top) != 0)) begin 
      m_state = UVM_PHASE_EXECUTING ;
      phase_done.wait_for(UVM_ALL_DROPPED, top);
      need_to_check_all = 1 ;
    end

    // now wait for siblings to drop
    foreach(siblings[sib]) begin
      sib.wait_for_state(UVM_PHASE_EXECUTING, UVM_GTE); // sibling must be at least executing 
      if ((sib.phase_done != null) && (sib.phase_done.get_objection_total(top) != 0)) begin
        m_state = UVM_PHASE_EXECUTING ;
        sib.phase_done.wait_for(UVM_ALL_DROPPED, top); // sibling must drop any objection
        need_to_check_all = 1 ;
      end
    end
  end
endtask
```

