clear_successors

* 被 [execute_phase](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2007%3A%20uvm_phase.md#m_run_phases) 调用，如果当前 phase 设置了 Jump phase，在跳转之前调用这个函数，把后续的 phase 设置为特定值
* 被调用了两次：
  * 第一次传入 - UVM_PHASE_DONE,m_jump_phase，把后续的 phase 设置为 UVM_PHASE_DONE
  * 第二次使用 m_jump_phase 直接调用，将要跳转的 phase 设置为 UVM_PHASE_DORMANT，以便重新把这些 phase 执行一次

* 调用 [clear]() 
```systemverilog
function void uvm_phase::clear_successors(uvm_phase_state state = UVM_PHASE_DORMANT, 
    uvm_phase end_state=null);
  if(this == end_state) 
    return;
  clear(state);
  foreach(m_successors[succ]) begin
    succ.clear_successors(state, end_state);
  end
endfunction
```

