run_test

* 被[uvm_globals:run_test](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03:%20uvm_base/chapter%2001:%20uvm_globals.md) 调用
* 使用[uvm_cmdline_processor](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2049%3A%20uvm_cmdline_processor.md) 对命令行中传入的 test name 进行解析，只保留第一次碰到的+UVM_TESTNAME 中所指定的 case。**如果同时在命令行和函数中同时制定了 test，那命令行中的信息有更高的优先级。**

* 调用[uvm_objection:m_init_objections](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2051%3A%20uvm_objection.md)，在环境的已开始就在 uvm_root 中触发这个无限循环，不断等待 m_scheduled_list 中出现内容，当有某一个 component 的全部 objection 都被 drop 了之后，就会用它来创建一个对象，并加入到这个 list 中

* 如果通过参数传入的test名字:调用[uvm_fatctory:create_component_by_name](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2003%3A%20uvm_factory.md#find_override_by_name) -> [uvm_object_registry:create_component](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2005%3A%20%20uvm_component_registry.md) -> [uvm_component:new](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2006%3A%20uvm_component.md) 方法创建一个test实例，因为是根据名字直接创建所以不需要传入 parent 指针，当 parent 为 null 的时候，默认作为 uvm_root 的子节点

* **test在环境中的名字是 uvm_test_top，是在这里创建的时候赋值的，最顶层的 test 需要通过名字来创建，所以不能通过 create 方法，因为 create 方法默认是通过 type 来创建**

* 检查`uvm_test_top(test)`是否挂载在`uvm_root`的`m_children`上，在验证平台搭建的时候，只有test没有直接调用create方法创建，因为前一步创建的时候使用的是`create_component_by_name`，并没有指明parent，这种情况下这个组件会直接挂载到`uvm_root`

* 调用[uvm_phase:m_run_phases](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2007%3A%20uvm_phase.md) 来启动phase和所有component的创建

  ![image](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/assets/66343787/94f4b1c9-63cd-4b9a-a3ee-e5fc1224dc0c)

* 执行 phase 线程

  <img width="650" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ac13e5be-ad0e-4998-9dbd-2355a66ad24a">

```systemverilog
task uvm_root::run_test(string test_name="");

  uvm_report_server l_rs;
  uvm_coreservice_t cs = uvm_coreservice_t::get();                                                     
  uvm_factory factory=cs.get_factory();
  bit testname_plusarg;
  int test_name_count;
  string test_names[$];
  string msg;
  uvm_component uvm_test_top;

  process phase_runner_proc; // store thread forked below for final cleanup

  testname_plusarg = 0;

  // Set up the process that decouples the thread that drops objections from
  // the process that processes drop/all_dropped objections. This ensures
  // that if the original calling thread gets killed, it does not affect
  // drain-time and propagation of the drop up the hierarchy.
  uvm_objection::m_init_objections();

`ifndef UVM_NO_DPI

  // Retrieve test names from command line, overriding the argument if present
  test_name_count = clp.get_arg_values("+UVM_TESTNAME=", test_names);

  // Use first test name if at least one is provided
  if (test_name_count > 0) begin
    test_name = test_names[0];
    testname_plusarg = 1;
  end

  // Warn if multiple test names are provided
  if (test_name_count > 1) begin
    string test_list;
    string sep;
    for (int i = 0; i < test_names.size(); i++) begin
      if (i != 0)
        sep = ", ";
      test_list = {test_list, sep, test_names[i]};
    end
    uvm_report_warning("MULTTST", 
      $sformatf("Multiple (%0d) +UVM_TESTNAME arguments provided on the command line.  '%s' will be used.  
      Provided list: %s.", test_name_count, test_name, test_list), UVM_NONE);
  end

`else

  // If UVM_NO_DPI is defined, get UVM_TESTNAME directly from plusarg
  if ($value$plusargs("UVM_TESTNAME=%s", test_name)) begin
    `uvm_info("NO_DPI_TSTNAME", "UVM_NO_DPI defined--getting UVM_TESTNAME directly, without DPI", UVM_NONE)
    testname_plusarg = 1;
  end

`endif

  // Create test instance if test name is provided
  if (test_name != "") begin
    uvm_coreservice_t cs = uvm_coreservice_t::get();                                                     
    uvm_factory factory=cs.get_factory();

    // Check if uvm_test_top already exists
    if(m_children.exists("uvm_test_top")) begin
      uvm_report_fatal("TTINST",
          "An uvm_test_top already exists via a previous call to run_test", UVM_NONE);
      #0; // forces shutdown because $finish is forked
    end

    // Create test component using factory
    $cast(uvm_test_top, factory.create_component_by_name(test_name,
          "", "uvm_test_top", null));

    // Report error if test creation fails
    if (uvm_test_top == null) begin
      msg = testname_plusarg ? {"command line +UVM_TESTNAME=",test_name} : 
                               {"call to run_test(",test_name,")"};
      uvm_report_fatal("INVTST",
          {"Requested test from ",msg, " not found." }, UVM_NONE);
    end
  end

  // Check if any components are instantiated
  // after test creation, this test should be the only child of uvm_root
  if (m_children.num() == 0) begin
    uvm_report_fatal("NOCOMP",
          {"No components instantiated. You must either instantiate",
           " at least one component before calling run_test or use",
           " run_test to do so. To run a test using run_test,",
           " use +UVM_TESTNAME or supply the test name in",

phase_started

* 在每个 phase 开始执行之前，会调用 phase_started，普通的 uvm_component 的 phase_started 是一个空函数，但是 uvm_root 则对重载了此函数
* ***resolve_bindings 是在 connect_phase 完毕之后，end_of_elaboration_phase 开始之前被调用的***
* 接下来要执行的是 end_of_elaboration_phase，调用 [uvm_component:do_resolve_bindings](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2006%3A%20uvm_component.md)

