get_common_domain

* 保存所有的domain信息 -> key: string value: uvm_domain
```systemverilog
static local uvm_domain m_domains[string];
```
* 保存运行时创建的domain，只在`get_common_domain`函数中被赋值

```systemverilog
static local uvm_domain m_common_domain;
```

* 被[uvm_phase:m_run_phases](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2007%3A%20uvm_phase.md)调用

![image](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/assets/66343787/f814f1b0-e86e-45e7-8bc4-00454b3687f7)

* uvm_domain 中的 get_common_domain 主要是干这么三件事情：

  * 创建上述phase有向图结构的第一部分
    * build->connect->end_of_elaboration->start_of_simulation->run->extract->check->report->final
  * 创建上述phase有向图结构的第二部分
    * pre_reset->reset->post_reset->pre_configure->configure->post_configure->pre_main->main->post_main->pre_shutdown->shutdown->post_shutdown
  * 正如phase有向图结构所示，(2)搞出来的东西是作为一个子图呈现在(1)所搞出来的结构中的；那么怎么让(2)搞出来的东西就成了(1)所搞出来的东西的一部分了呢？而且还要和run phase并行的运行呢？还是要靠这个add函数！只不过需要用到add函数形参表中一个叫做with_phase的东西，显而易见，这个定义在uvm phase class中的add函数真是无比的重要，正式它让我们可以根据需要把一个个phase节点组织成一个任意的被UVM 规则所允许的图形结构

![image](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/assets/66343787/85397f21-8c74-446f-ace4-a8b3e975261b)

* 创建一个公共的domain,调用[uvm_phase:add](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03:%20uvm_base/chapter%2007:%20uvm_phase.md)方法将所有的phase加入, 先加入静态的`phase`，之后通过[uvm_domain:get_uvm_domain]()获取添加了动态`phase`的`m_uvm_schedule`并加入。

```systemverilog
static function uvm_domain get_common_domain();

  uvm_domain domain;
  uvm_phase schedule;

  if (m_common_domain != null)
    return m_common_domain;

  //创建 domain
  domain = new("common");

  //添加 function phase - 不断改变 domain 的 m_end_node 指针，指向当前 domain 的最后一个 phase
  //phase 之间的关系通过 m_successors/m_predecessors 指针来维护
  domain.add(uvm_build_phase::get());
  domain.add(uvm_connect_phase::get());
  domain.add(uvm_end_of_elaboration_phase::get());
  domain.add(uvm_start_of_simulation_phase::get());
  domain.add(uvm_run_phase::get());
  domain.add(uvm_extract_phase::get());
  domain.add(uvm_check_phase::get());
  domain.add(uvm_report_phase::get());
  domain.add(uvm_final_phase::get());
  m_domains["common"] = domain;

  // for backward compatibility, make common phases visible;
  // same as uvm_<name>_phase::get().
  build_ph               = domain.find(uvm_build_phase::get());
  connect_ph             = domain.find(uvm_connect_phase::get());
  end_of_elaboration_ph  = domain.find(uvm_end_of_elaboration_phase::get());
  start_of_simulation_ph = domain.find(uvm_start_of_simulation_phase::get());
  run_ph                 = domain.find(uvm_run_phase::get());   
  extract_ph             = domain.find(uvm_extract_phase::get());
  check_ph               = domain.find(uvm_check_phase::get());
  report_ph              = domain.find(uvm_report_phase::get());
  m_common_domain = domain;

  //创建 task phase
  domain = get_uvm_domain();

  //将 task domain 和 run phase 并行
  m_common_domain.add(domain,
                    .with_phase(m_common_domain.find(uvm_run_phase::get())));

  //返回一个完整的domain结构
  return m_common_domain;

endfunction
```

