uvm_phase_state

* 用于标识一个 phase 的执行情况，是已经执行完了还是根本没有执行还是正在执行
  * UVM_PHASE_DORMANT：这个 domain 中的 phase 什么都没有做过
  * UVM_PHASE_SCHEDULED：至少有一个先驱 phase 已经完成，正在等待所有其它的先驱 phase 完成
  * UVM_PHASE_SYNCING：所有的先驱 phase 已经完成，正跨 domian 检查各个需 要同步的 phase
  * UVM_PHASE_STARTED：表示 phase 已经开始，调用 phase_started callback 函数
  * UVM_PHASE_EXECUTING：表示 phase 正在执行
  * UVM_PHASE_READY_TO_END：表示 phase 已经结束，正在等待完成，如 run 结束后等待 post_shutdown 完成
  * UVM_PHASE_ENDED：表示 phase 已经执行完，调用phase_ended callback 函数
  * UVM_PHASE_CLEANUP：表示 phase 相关的各进程被 kill 掉
  * UVM_PHASE_DONE：表示本 phase 已经执行完毕，接下来的 phase 可以执行

![image](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/assets/66343787/8b1e2f74-000c-41ca-9135-23a84ecc02bd)


```systemverilog
//|   UNINITIALIZED -> DORMANT -> SCHED -> SYNC -> START -> EXEC -> READY -> END -+-> CLEAN -> DONE
//|                       ^                                                       |
//|                       |                      <-- jump_to                      |
//|                       +-------------------------------------------- JUMPING< -+

typedef enum{ 
  UVM_PHASE_UNINITIALIZED = 0,
  //The state is uninitialized. This is the default state for phases, and for nodes which have not yet been added to a schedule.

  UVM_PHASE_DORMANT       = 1,
  //The schedule is not currently operating on the phase node, however it will be scheduled at some point in the future.

  UVM_PHASE_SCHEDULED     = 2,
  //At least one immediate predecessor has completed. Scheduled phases block until all predecessors complete or until a jump is executed.

  UVM_PHASE_SYNCING       = 4,
  //All predecessors complete, checking that all synced phases (e.g. across domains) are at or beyond this point

  UVM_PHASE_STARTED       = 8,
  //phase ready to execute, running phase_started() callback

  UVM_PHASE_EXECUTING     = 16,
  //An executing phase is one where the phase callbacks are being executed. Its process is tracked by the phaser.

  UVM_PHASE_READY_TO_END  = 32,
  //no objections remain in this phase or in any predecessors of its successors or in any sync'd phases. This 
  //state indicates an opportunity for any phase that needs extra time for a clean exit to raise an objection, 
  //thereby causing a return to UVM_PHASE_EXECUTING. If no objection is raised, state will transition to 
  //UVM_PHASE_ENDED after a delta cycle.

  UVM_PHASE_ENDED         = 64,
  //phase completed execution, now running phase_ended() callback

  UVM_PHASE_CLEANUP       = 128,
  //all processes related to phase are being killed

  UVM_PHASE_DONE          = 256,
  //A phase is done after it terminated execution. Becoming done may enable a waiting successor phase to execute.

  UVM_PHASE_JUMPING       = 512
  //all processes related to phase are being killed and all predecessors are forced into the DONE state.
} uvm_phase_state;
```

