field_automation

* 查看标志位的时候从高位到地位，如果高位的置起，关闭某项操作
* UVM_ALL_ON|UVM_NOPACK的结果就是‘b000001101010101。这样UVM 在执行pack操作时，首先检查bit9，发现其为1，直接忽略bit8所代表的UVM_PACK

* 在这个17bit的数字中，bit0表示copy，bit1表示no_copy，bit2表示compare，bit3表示no_compare，bit4表示print，bit5表示 no_print，bit6表示record，bit7表示no_record，bit8表示pack，bit9表示no_pack

```systemverilog
// Field automation flags
//
// These flags control how fields are processed during various operations:

// UVM_DEFAULT   - Enable all field operations (default behavior)
//                 Equivalent to: UVM_COPY | UVM_COMPARE | UVM_PRINT | UVM_RECORD | UVM_PACK

// Copy-related flags:
// UVM_COPY      - Include field in uvm_object::copy() operation
// UVM_NOCOPY    - Exclude field from uvm_object::copy() operation

// Compare-related flags:  
// UVM_COMPARE   - Include field in uvm_object::compare() operation
// UVM_NOCOMPARE - Exclude field from uvm_object::compare() operation

// Print-related flags:
// UVM_PRINT     - Include field in uvm_object::print() operation  
// UVM_NOPRINT   - Exclude field from uvm_object::print() operation

// Record-related flags:
// UVM_RECORD    - Include field in uvm_object::record() operation
// UVM_NORECORD  - Exclude field from uvm_object::record() operation

// Pack-related flags:
// UVM_PACK      - Include field in uvm_object::pack() operation
// UVM_NOPACK    - Exclude field from uvm_object::pack() operation

// Object copy depth flags:
// UVM_DEEP      - Perform deep copy of object fields (recursive copy)
// UVM_SHALLOW   - Perform shallow copy of object fields (copy only the reference)
// UVM_REFERENCE - Copy object fields by reference (no actual copying)

// Miscellaneous flags:
// UVM_READONLY  - Field will not be automatically configured
//                 Useful for protecting certain fields from modification

// Note: These flags can be combined using bitwise OR to customize field behavior
```
```systemverilog
// Field automation flags
// A = ABSTRACT, Y = PHYSICAL
// F = REFERENCE, S = SHALLOW, D = DEEP
// K = PACK, R = RECORD, P = PRINT, M = COMPARE, C = COPY
//                                AYFSD K R P M C
parameter UVM_DEFAULT     = 'b000010101010101; // Default behavior: enable all operations except ABSTRACT
parameter UVM_ALL_ON      = 'b000000101010101; // Enable all operations
parameter UVM_FLAGS_ON    = 'b000000101010101; // Same as UVM_ALL_ON
parameter UVM_FLAGS_OFF   = 0;                 // Disable all operations

// Individual flags (can be OR'ed together)
parameter UVM_COPY         = (1<<0);  // Enable copy operation
parameter UVM_NOCOPY       = (1<<1);  // Disable copy operation
parameter UVM_COMPARE      = (1<<2);  // Enable compare operation
parameter UVM_NOCOMPARE    = (1<<3);  // Disable compare operation
parameter UVM_PRINT        = (1<<4);  // Enable print operation
parameter UVM_NOPRINT      = (1<<5);  // Disable print operation
parameter UVM_RECORD       = (1<<6);  // Enable record operation
parameter UVM_NORECORD     = (1<<7);  // Disable record operation
parameter UVM_PACK         = (1<<8);  // Enable pack operation
parameter UVM_NOPACK       = (1<<9);  // Disable pack operation
// Commented out flags (not used in this version)
// parameter UVM_DEEP         = (1<<10); // Deep copy/compare
// parameter UVM_SHALLOW      = (1<<11); // Shallow copy/compare
// parameter UVM_REFERENCE    = (1<<12); // Reference copy/compare

parameter UVM_PHYSICAL     = (1<<13); // Treat field as physical
parameter UVM_ABSTRACT     = (1<<14); // Treat field as abstract
parameter UVM_READONLY     = (1<<15); // Field is read-only (cannot be configured)
parameter UVM_NODEFPRINT   = (1<<16); // Exclude field from default print

// Note: These flags can be combined using bitwise OR to customize field behavior
// For example: UVM_DEFAULT | UVM_NOCOPY would enable all operations except copy
```

