execute

* 被[traverse]() 调用，执行具体 component 的 phase 中的内容
* 调用[uvm_build_phase:exec_func](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2011%3A%20uvm_common_phases.md)或者其他 phase 中当前函数的具体实现
```systemverilog
virtual function void execute(uvm_component comp,
                                        uvm_phase phase);
  // reseed this process for random stability
  process proc = process::self();
  proc.srandom(uvm_create_random_seed(phase.get_type_name(), comp.get_full_name()));

  comp.m_current_phase = phase;
  exec_func(comp,phase);
endfunction
