uvm_report

* 被 [uvm_report_info/uvm_report_error/uvm_report_fatal/uvm_report_warning]() 调用，分别传入不同的参数

  <img width="700" alt="image" src="https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/assets/66343787/ca7a39e9-79c8-4de0-ad38-f25207fd037e">

* 参数：
  * severity: 当前类型 - UVM_INFO/UVM_WARNING/UVM_ERROR
  * id: class name
  * message: print info
  * verbosity: verbosity of this message, usually use default value for UVM_ERROR and  UVM_FATAL
  * filename: `uvm_file
  * line: `uvm_line

* 调用 [uvm_report_enabled]()，只有当当前语句的verbosity(右侧)小于环境的verbosity(左侧)时候才继续进行处理
* 调用 [uvm_report_message:set_report_message](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/new/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base) 使用当前信息创建一个对象

* 调用 [uvm_process_report_message]() 来处理 report 信息，到这里这一条信息正式进入到处理阶段，脱离了这个类

```systemverilog
// Function: uvm_report
// This function is the core reporting method in UVM.
// It processes and dispatches messages based on severity and verbosity levels.
virtual function void uvm_report( uvm_severity severity,
                                  string id,
                                  string message,
                                  // Default verbosity based on severity
                                  int verbosity = (severity == uvm_severity'(UVM_ERROR)) ? UVM_LOW :
                                                  (severity == uvm_severity'(UVM_FATAL)) ? UVM_NONE : UVM_MEDIUM,
                                  string filename = "",
                                  int line = 0,
                                  string context_name = "",
                                  bit report_enabled_checked =0);
  uvm_report_message l_report_message;

  // Check if reporting is enabled for this message
  if (report_enabled_checked == 0) begin
    if (!uvm_report_enabled(verbosity, severity, id))
      return;
  end

  // Create a new report message
  l_report_message = uvm_report_message::new_report_message();

  // Set the report message details(copy the input parameters to the message object)
  l_report_message.set_report_message(severity, id, message, 
        verbosity, filename, line, context_name);

  // Process the report message
  uvm_process_report_message(l_report_message);
endfunction 
```

