| Array Name | Type | Purpose | Function for Adding Items |
|------------|------|---------|---------------------------|
| id_verbosities | associative array: string[int] | Stores verbosity levels for specific message IDs | set_id_verbosity |
| severity_id_verbosities | associative array: uvm_severity[associative array: string[int]] | Stores verbosity levels for specific combinations of severity and message ID | set_severity_id_verbosity |
| id_actions | associative array: string[uvm_action] | Stores actions for specific message IDs | set_id_action |
| severity_actions | associative array: uvm_severity[uvm_action] | Stores default actions for each severity level | set_severity_action |
| severity_id_actions | associative array: uvm_severity[associative array: string[uvm_action]] | Stores actions for specific combinations of severity and message ID | set_severity_id_action |
