```

* 被[uvm_report_object:uvm_process_report_message](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/edit/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2014%3A%20uvm_report_object.md)调用

* 先检查是否有对severity的重写信息，如果有就更新信息。
* 由于检查override信息是在`uvm_report_enabled`函数调用之前，所以用**来检查判断verbosity的是原始severity而不是重写之后的信息**。因此即使对 severity 信息进行了重写，且如果使用新的 severity 查找到的环境中的 verbosity 不满足输出条件(可以针对 severity+id 单独设置 verbosity)，依然会进入到这个函数

* 但是对message行为的设定是在severity重写之后进行的，所以message的具体行为是根据新的severity判断的。使用新的 severity+id 查找并重置 file 和 action。

* 调用[uvm_report_server:process_report_message](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/new/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base)

```systemverilog
virtual function void process_report_message(uvm_report_message report_message);
  process p = process::self();
  uvm_report_server srvr = uvm_report_server::get_server();

  // ID 是使用 macro 打印时候的传入的第一个字符串
  string id = report_message.get_id();
  uvm_severity severity = report_message.get_severity();

  // 先检查是否对 id 有重写，如果有再检查是否对当前severity有重写，如果对 id 有重写，
  // 但是对 severity 没有重写，则即使全局有对 severity 的重写，也不会生效
  if(sev_id_overrides.exists(id)) begin
    if(sev_id_overrides[id].exists(uvm_severity'(severity))) begin
      severity = sev_id_overrides[id].get(severity);
      report_message.set_severity(severity);
    end
  end
  else begin
    if(sev_overrides.exists(severity)) begin
      severity = sev_overrides.get(severity);
      report_message.set_severity(severity);
    end
  end

  //using the new severity and id to get file and action - can be overridden to specific behavior
  report_message.set_file(get_file_handle(severity, id));
  report_message.set_report_handler(this);
  report_message.set_action(get_action(severity, id));
  srvr.process_report_message(report_message);

endfunction
```

