compare_object

* [uvm_recursion_policy_enum](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/edit/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2010%3A%20uvm_object_globals.md)决定了在比较两个类的实例的时候，是仅仅比较句柄还是要具体的比较类中每个字段是否一致。
* 先采用句柄比较，后面调用[uvm_object:compare](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2019%3A%20uvm_object.md#compare)对值进行一一比较

  <img width="530" alt="image" src="https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/assets/66343787/72f253bb-c53e-43d2-8086-94f777428d11">


* Purpose: Compares UVM objects, considering the recursion policy.
* Operation:
  - First checks if the objects are identical (same reference).
  - If policy is UVM_REFERENCE, only compares object references.
  - Handles null object cases.
  - For deep comparison, calls the compare method of the lhs object.
  - Uses scope stack to track hierarchical comparisons.
* Key feature: Flexible comparison based on recursion policy.

```systemverilog
virtual function bit compare_object (string name,
                                     uvm_object lhs,
                                     uvm_object rhs);
  if (rhs == lhs)
    return 1;

  if (policy == UVM_REFERENCE && lhs != rhs) begin
    uvm_object::__m_uvm_status_container.scope.set_arg(name);
    print_msg_object(lhs, rhs);
    return 0;
  end

  if (rhs == null || lhs == null) begin
    uvm_object::__m_uvm_status_container.scope.set_arg(name);
    print_msg_object(lhs, rhs);
    return 0;  //miscompare
  end

  uvm_object::__m_uvm_status_container.scope.down(name);
  compare_object = lhs.compare(rhs, this);
  uvm_object::__m_uvm_status_container.scope.up();

endfunction
```

