set

* 把指定resource加入到resource pool中，函数set()有两个参数，第一个参数是uvm_resource_base类型句柄rsrc，指向要被存储的资源类uvm_resource#(T)，第二个参数是uvm_resource_types类中的静态变量override_t，表示该笔资源在存到相应队列时是否要override之前已存在的资源。

* 被[uvm_resource:set](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03:%20uvm_base/chapter%2026:%20uvm_resource.md)调用
* 调用[uvm_resource:get_name/uvm_resource_base:get_type_handle](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03:%20uvm_base/chapter%2026:%20uvm_resource.md)获取对象信息
* rq 是一个队列，其中存放的内容是 uvm_resource_base 类型

* 先尝试将资源存放到 `rtab` 中，先通过名字查找到对应的队列，若为override模式，则把resource插入队首，否则插入队尾

  * 调用 [uvm_object:get_name](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2019%3A%20uvm_object.md) 返回字符串变量m_leaf_name，此时这个m_leaf_name其实就是我们在创建uvm_resource #(T)类实例调用new()时传入的第一个字符串参数。get_name()是uvm_object中定义的函数，返回其中的字符串变量m_leaf_name，在uvm_resource_base的new()函数中会调用uvm_object的new()函数，在其中把传入的字符串变量name赋值给m_leaf_name。

  * 若get_name()返回值name不是空字符串，则判断数组rtab[]是否已经有了以这个字符串为索引的内容，若没有则调用new()创建一个uvm_resource_types::rsrc_q_t类型队列，若override_t是NAME_OVERRIDE，则将第一个参数传入的rsrc句柄存入该队列最前端，否则存入该队列最后面，然后将该队列以name为索引存入数组rtab[]。

* 再尝试将资源存放到 `ttab` 中，先通过类型查找到对应的队列，若为override模式，则把resource插入队首，否则插入队尾

  * 调用 [uvm_resource:get_type_handle](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2026%3A%20uvm_resource.md#get_type_handle) 拿到该uvm_resource #(T)类唯一对象句柄type_handle， **无论是传入什么类型，都会被封装成 uvm_resource_base 的子类**，若数组ttab[]中没有以该句柄为索引的内容，则调用new()创建一个uvm_resource_types::rsrc_q_t类型队列，若override_t是TYPE_OVERRIDE，则将第一个参数传入的rsrc句柄存入该队列最前端，否则存入该队列最后面，最后将该队列以type_handle为索引存入数组ttab[]。


| Aspect | rtab | ttab |
|--------|------|------|
| Declaration | uvm_resource_types::rsrc_q_t rtab [string] | uvm_resource_types::rsrc_q_t ttab [uvm_resource_base] |
| Key Type | string | uvm_resource_base |
| Value Type | uvm_resource_types::rsrc_q_t (queue) | uvm_resource_types::rsrc_q_t (queue) |
| Indexing | By resource name | By resource type handle |
| Purpose | Stores resources indexed by their names | Stores resources indexed by their types |
| Queue Content | Resources with the same name | Resources of the same type |
| Used in | name-based lookups | type-based lookups |
| Set Operation | Inserts resource into queue indexed by name | Inserts resource into queue indexed by type handle |
| Lookup Operation | lookup_name() | lookup_type() |
| Override Behavior | Can use NAME_OVERRIDE | Can use TYPE_OVERRIDE |
| Priority Setting | set_priority_name() | set_priority_type() |

```systemverilog
function void set(uvm_resource_base rsrc, 
                  uvm_resource_types::override_t override = 0 //this is a bitwise or of NAME_OVERRIDE and TYPE_OVERRIDE
                  );

  // Declare variables
  uvm_resource_types::rsrc_q_t rq;
  string name;
  uvm_resource_base type_handle;

  // Return if the resource is null
  if (rsrc == null)
    return;

  // Save resource info by name
  name = rsrc.get_name();
  if (name != "") begin
    // Check if the name already exists in the resource table
    if (rtab.exists(name))
      rq = rtab[name];
    else
      rq = new();

    // Insert resource into the queue based on override type
    if (override & uvm_resource_types::NAME_OVERRIDE)
      rq.push_front(rsrc);
    else
      rq.push_back(rsrc);

    // Update the resource table with the new queue
    rtab[name] = rq;
  end

  // Insert resource into the type map
  type_handle = rsrc.get_type_handle();
  if (ttab.exists(type_handle))
    rq = ttab[type_handle];
  else
    rq = new();

  // Insert resource into the queue based on override type
  if (override & uvm_resource_types::TYPE_OVERRIDE)
    rq.push_front(rsrc);
  else
    rq.push_back(rsrc);

  // Update the type table with the new queue
  ttab[type_handle] = rq;

endfunction
```

