get_by_name

* 被[uvm_resource:get_by_name](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2026%3A%20uvm_resource.md)调用
* [lookup_name]()返回 rtab 中索引为 name 的 队列中 scope 与输入的 scope 吻合，type_handle 与输入的 type_handle 吻合的记录，由于记录可能有多个，因此这些记录被放入一个队列中返回。
* 调用 [get_highest_precedence]() **返回队列中优先级最高的对象**。

```systemverilog
function uvm_resource_base get_by_name(string scope = "",
                                       string name,
                                       uvm_resource_base type_handle,
                                       bit rpterr = 1);

  // Declare a queue to hold the resources found by name
  uvm_resource_types::rsrc_q_t q;
  // Declare a variable to hold the resource with the highest precedence
  uvm_resource_base rsrc;

  // Lookup resources by name and store them in the queue
  q = lookup_name(scope, name, type_handle, rpterr);

  // If no resources are found, record the get operation and return null
  if(q.size() == 0) begin
    push_get_record(name, scope, null);
    return null;
  end

  // Get the resource with the highest precedence from the queue
  rsrc = get_highest_precedence(q);
  // Record the get operation with the found resource
  push_get_record(name, scope, rsrc);
  // Return the resource with the highest precedence
  return rsrc;

endfunction
```
---

lookup_name

* 被 [get_by_name]() 调用，根据name查找name table中的resource,返回符合匹配规则的resource队列
* 若传入的字符串name为空，则返回一个空队列。若数组rtab[]中没有相关记录且rpterr为1，则调用 [spell_check]() 并返回一个空队列。
* 否则遍历以name为索引的这个队列，若参数传入的type_handle为空或者与队列中某个元素一致，并且match_scope()返回1，则这些元素放入一个uvm_resource_types::rsrc_q_t类型队列q并返回q。
* 函数 [uvm_resource #(type T=int):match_scope](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03:%20uvm_base/chapter%2026:%20uvm_resource.md) 会调用函数 [uvm_re_match]() 来检测scope是否可以与参数传入的字符串匹配。


* 先查找是否存在于rtab中，如果不存在则直接返回空队列
* 如果存在就遍历队列中所有元素并 **返回所有** 符合要求的元素

  * 这里的条件有两种:
    * 一是 scope 完全的匹配，并且 type_handle 为 null
    * 二是 scope 完全的匹配，并且记录的 type_handle 与输入的 type_handle 完全一样。

```systemverilog
function uvm_resource_types::rsrc_q_t lookup_name(
  string scope = "",
  string name,
  uvm_resource_base type_handle = null,
  bit rpterr = 1
);
  // Declare variables
  uvm_resource_types::rsrc_q_t rq;
  uvm_resource_types::rsrc_q_t q;
  uvm_resource_base rsrc;
  uvm_resource_base r;

  // Ensure rand stability during lookup
  begin
    process p = process::self();
    string s;
    if (p != null) s = p.get_randstate();
    q = new();
    if (p != null) p.set_randstate(s);
  end

  // Resources with empty names are anonymous and do not exist in the name map
  if (name == "")
    return q;

  // Check if an entry in the name map exists with the specified name
  // If not, then we're done
  if (!rtab.exists(name)) begin
    if (rpterr) void'(spell_check(name));
    return q;
  end

  // Initialize resource and get the queue associated with the name
  rsrc = null;
  rq = rtab[name];

  // Iterate through the queue and check if the type and scope match
  for (int i = 0; i < rq.size(); ++i) begin
    r = rq.get(i);
    if (
        // Condition 1: Either no specific type is required, or the resource type matches the required type
        (
            (type_handle == null) ||
            (r.get_type_handle() == type_handle)
        )
        &&
        // Condition 2: The resource's scope matches the required scope
        r.match_scope(scope)
    )
      q.push_back(r);
  end

  // Return the queue of matching resources
  return q;

endfunction
```
