get_by_type

* 被[uvm_resource:get_by_type](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2026%3A%20uvm_resource.md)调用

* 可以通过字符串scope和uvm_resource_base类型句柄type_handle来找到数组中相应资源
* 首先调用 [lookup_type]() 取得符合条件的资源队列句柄q，若q为空队列，则调用push_get_record()记录下这次访问信息并返回。否则 **返回q中第一个元素** 并同样记录下这次访问信息。

```systemverilog
function uvm_resource_base get_by_type(string scope = "",
                                       uvm_resource_base type_handle);

  uvm_resource_types::rsrc_q_t q;
  uvm_resource_base rsrc;

  q = lookup_type(scope, type_handle);

  if(q.size() == 0) begin
    push_get_record("<type>", scope, null);
    return null;
  end

  rsrc = q.get(0);
  push_get_record("<type>", scope, rsrc);
  return rsrc;

endfunction
```

