find_unused_resources

* 被 [uvm_component:check_config_usage](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03:%20uvm_base/chapter%2006:%20uvm_component.md) 调用，遍历资源池数组rtab[]中的每一笔资源，检查数组access[]中储存的所有不同accessor对其的访问信息，**若某资源只有写入记录而从未有过任何读记录**，则将其放入队列q中，最后返回q。

```systemverilog
function uvm_resource_types::rsrc_q_t find_unused_resources();

  uvm_resource_types::rsrc_q_t rq;
  uvm_resource_types::rsrc_q_t q = new;
  int unsigned i;
  uvm_resource_base r;
  uvm_resource_types::access_t a;
  int reads;
  int writes;

  foreach (rtab[name]) begin
    rq = rtab[name];
    for(int i=0; i<rq.size(); ++i) begin
      r = rq.get(i);
      reads = 0;
      writes = 0;
      foreach(r.access[str]) begin
        a = r.access[str];
        reads += a.read_count;
        writes += a.write_count;
      end
      if(writes > 0 && reads == 0)
        q.push_back(r);
    end
  end

  return q;

endfunction
```

