my_port.debug_connected_to(0, 2); // Only show up to 2 levels deep

This port's fanout network:

  my_port (uvm_tlm_analysis_fifo #(transaction))
    |
    |_connected_port1 (uvm_analysis_port #(transaction))
    | |
    | |_connected_port2 (uvm_analysis_imp #(transaction))
    |
    |_another_connected_port (uvm_analysis_export #(transaction))

