* 定义了两个静态联合数组 `m_rsc` 和 `m_waiters`。其中 `m_rsc` 以uvm_component类型为索引，储存内容为 [uvm_pool](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2033%3A%20uvm_pool.md) 类型

