m_traverse

* 被[uvm_phase:execute_phase](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2007%3A%20uvm_phase.md)调用，传入 uvm_root 和不同的状态类型 - UVM_PHASE_STARTED/UVM_PHASE_EXECUTING/UVM_PHASE_ENDED，只有中间的状态会执行具体的内容，其他两种状态没有实质性执行的内容，需要添加回调函数

* 调用[uvm_phase:get_domain](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2007%3A%20uvm_phase.md) 获取当前 phase 所属的 domain；调用[uvm_component:get_domain](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03:%20uvm_base/chapter%2006:%20uvm_component.md) 获取当前 class 所属的 domain，检查两者是否相同，只有在相同的情况下才可以执行，如果将 component 添加到一个新的 domain 中，则可以发生不同的情况


* 根据不同的参数状态进行执行
  * UVM_PHASE_STARTED: 调用一个空函数[uvm_component:phase_started](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03:%20uvm_base/chapter%2006:%20uvm_component.md)
  * UVM_PHASE_EXECUTING: 调用[execute]() 函数，开始执行每一个 component 定义在 phase 中的具体内容。
  * UVM_PHASE_ENDED: 调用一个空函数[uvm_component:phase_ended](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03:%20uvm_base/chapter%2006:%20uvm_component.md)

* 这个 phase 是自从下而上运行，因此先递归的调用每一个component的 traverse 再执行

* 如果当前的 component 是一个 sequencer，则需要有调用额外的函数来控制 sequencer 的开始和结束

  * UVM_PHASE_STARTED: 调用 [uvm_sequencer_base:start_phase_sequence](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2003%3A%20uvm_sequencer_base.md#start_phase_sequence)
  * UVM_PHASE_ENDED: 调用 [uvm_sequencer_base:stop_phase_sequence](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2003%3A%20uvm_sequencer_base.md#stop_phase_sequence)

```systemverilog
function void m_traverse(uvm_component comp,
                         uvm_phase phase,
                         uvm_phase_state state);
  string name;
  uvm_domain phase_domain =phase.get_domain();
  uvm_domain comp_domain = comp.get_domain();
  uvm_sequencer_base seqr;

  // Recursively traverse child components
  if (comp.get_first_child(name))
    do
      m_traverse(comp.get_child(name), phase, state);
    while(comp.get_next_child(name));

  // Debug trace message
  if (m_phase_trace)
  `uvm_info("PH_TRACE",$sformatf("topdown-phase phase=%s state=%s comp=%s comp.domain=%s phase.domain=%s",
        phase.get_name(), state.name(), comp.get_full_name(),comp_domain.get_name(),phase_domain.get_name()),
        UVM_DEBUG)

  // Only execute if phase domain matches component domain or is common domain
  if (phase_domain == uvm_domain::get_common_domain() ||
      phase_domain == comp_domain) begin
    case (state)
      UVM_PHASE_STARTED: begin
        // Set current phase and apply verbosity settings
        comp.m_current_phase = phase;
        comp.m_apply_verbosity_settings(phase);
        comp.phase_started(phase);
        // Start phase sequence if component is a sequencer
        if ($cast(seqr, comp))
          seqr.start_phase_sequence(phase);
        end
      UVM_PHASE_EXECUTING: begin
        uvm_phase ph = this; 
        // Use component-specific phase implementation if it exists
        if (comp.m_phase_imps.exists(this))
          ph = comp.m_phase_imps[this];
        ph.execute(comp, phase);
        end
      UVM_PHASE_READY_TO_END: begin
        comp.phase_ready_to_end(phase);
        end
      UVM_PHASE_ENDED: begin
        // Stop phase sequence if component is a sequencer
        if ($cast(seqr, comp))
          seqr.stop_phase_sequence(phase);
        comp.phase_ended(phase);
        comp.m_current_phase = null;
        end
      default:
        `uvm_fatal("PH_BADEXEC","task phase traverse internal error")
    endcase
  end

endfunction
```

---

execute

* 调用[uvm_runtime_phase:exec_task](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2013%3A%20uvm_runtime_phases.md)，执行当前component 的 phase
* 由于使用了 join_none 的形式，所以并不等待这些 task 执行完毕就直接退出 execute 了。所以说类似 run_phase 等这些花费时间的 task，它们是通过自底向上的方式 fork 起来，但是却是同时运行的。
```systemverilog
virtual function void execute(uvm_component comp, uvm_phase phase);
  fork
    begin
      process proc;

      // reseed this process for random stability
      proc = process::self();
      proc.srandom(uvm_create_random_seed(phase.get_type_name(), comp.get_full_name()));

      phase.m_num_procs_not_yet_returned++;
      // call component.phase(phase)
      exec_task(comp,phase);
      phase.m_num_procs_not_yet_returned--;

    end
  join_none
endfunction
```

