check_registration

* 被[uvm_callbacks:add](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2039%3A%20uvm_callbacks.md)调用
