| Parameter | Type | Scope | Description |
|-----------|------|-------|-------------|
| m_typename | static string | uvm_callbacks | Represents the name of type T |
| super_type::m_typename | static string | uvm_typed_callbacks | Also represents the name of type T (inherited from parent class) |
| m_typeid.typename | string | uvm_typeid_base | Represents the name of type T in the type ID system |
| m_cb_typename | static string | uvm_callbacks | Represents the name of the callback type CB |
| m_cb_typeid.typename | string | uvm_typeid_base | Represents the name of the callback type CB in the type ID system |
| tname | string | Function parameter | Input parameter representing the name of type T |
| cbname | string | Function parameter | Input parameter representing the name of callback type CB |

* 表征名字的变量赋值:
    * uvm_callbacks#(mii_driver, A) 的 m_typename=”mii_driver”
    * uvm_typed_callbacks#(mii_driver)的 m_typename=”mii_driver”
    * m_typeid 即全局唯一的 uvm_typeid#(mii_driver)的 typename=”mii_driver”
    * uvm_callbacks#(mii_driver, A) 的 m_cb_typename=”A”
    * m_cb_typeid 即全局唯一的 uvm_typeid#(A)的 typename=”A”

```systemverilog
static function bit m_register_pair(string tname="", cbname="");
    // Get the singleton instance of this callback type
    this_type inst = get();

    // Set the typename for T
    m_typename = tname;
    super_type::m_typename = tname;
    m_typeid.typename = tname;

    // Set the typename for CB
    m_cb_typename = cbname;
    m_cb_typeid.typename = cbname;

    // Mark this pair as registered
    inst.m_registered = 1; 

    // Return success
    return 1;
endfunction
```
