register_super_type

* 被[uvm_callback_defines:uvm_set_super_type](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/02:%20uvm_macros/chapter%2001:%20uvm_callback_defines.md)调用

```systemverilog
typedef uvm_derived_callbacks#(T,ST,CB) this_type;
typedef uvm_callbacks#(T)               this_user_type;
typedef uvm_callbacks#(ST)              this_super_type;
```

* 调用 [uvm_callbacks:get](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2039%3A%20uvm_callbacks.md) 方法，u_inst 最终的值将会是 uvm_callbacks# (derived_driver, uvm_callback)全局唯一的一个实例。
* 调用 [get]() 方法，创建 inst 最终会指向唯一的 uvm_derived_callbacks# (derived_driver, mii_driver, uvm_callback)的实例。

* 检查是否设置了[uvm_callbacks_base:m_super_type](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2037%3A%20uvm_callbacks_base.md) 检查设置的父类型是不是传入的类型，是的话就直接返回，否则给出警告信息。**因此 callback 的继承关系只支持单继承，不支持重复设置**

* 使用子(child_driver)在 typeid_map 中拿到

  ![image](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/assets/66343787/eefcb847-9df1-4ac8-bae6-41009def9faa)

* **本质就是在父类的 uvm_callback#(base_driver, uvm_callback)的 m_derived_types 中插入子类的一条记录，并把子类的 uvm_callbacks#(child_driver, uvm_callback)的 m_super_type 设置为父类，即 base_driver**

```systemverilog
static function bit register_super_type(string tname="", sname="");

  //tname:child_driver
  //sname:base_driver

  //uvm_callbacks#(T)
  //uvm_callbacks#(child_driver, uvm_callback)
  this_user_type u_inst = this_user_type::get();

  //uvm_derived_callbacks#(T,ST,CB)
  //uvm_derived_callbacks#(child_driver, base_driver, uvm_callback)
  this_type      inst = this_type::get();
  uvm_callbacks_base s_obj;

  this_user_type::m_t_inst.m_typename = tname;

  if(sname != "") m_s_typeid.typename = sname;

  //uvm_callbacks_base.m_super_type
  if(u_inst.m_super_type != null) begin
    //检查设置的父类型是不是传入的类型，是的话就直接返回，否则给出警告信息
    if(u_inst.m_super_type == m_s_typeid) return 1;
    uvm_report_warning("CBTPREG", { "Type ", tname, " is already registered to super type ", 
      this_super_type::m_t_inst.m_typename, ". Ignoring attempt to register to super type ",
      sname}, UVM_NONE); 
    return 1;
  end

  if(this_super_type::m_t_inst.m_typename == "")
    this_super_type::m_t_inst.m_typename = sname;

  //m_s_typeid=uvm_typeid#(base_driver)::get()
  //设置 callback 关系中的父类信息
  //二者实际上是对同一个实例的 m_super_type 进行设置，因为通常情况下实例化时候传入的 callback=null
  //如果这样初始化，则不同: uvm_derived_callbacks# (derived_driver, mii_driver, C)
  u_inst.m_super_type = m_s_typeid;
  u_inst.m_base_inst.m_super_type = m_s_typeid;

  s_obj = uvm_typeid_base::typeid_map[m_s_typeid];
  s_obj.m_derived_types.push_back(m_typeid);
  return 1;
endfunction
```

