set_propagate_mode

* 这个函数用来设置 m_prop_mode，这个参数可以用来控制在 raise objection 的时候是否要递归对所有的 parent 都添加 objection

* By default, objections support hierarchical propagation for components.  

  ```
  //|                      | count | total |
  //| uvm_top.parent.child |     1 |    1  |
  //| uvm_top.parent       |     0 |    1  |
  //| uvm_top              |     0 |    1  |
  ```

* When propagation mode is set to 0, all intermediate callbacks between the ~source~ and ~top~ will be skipped.

  ```
  //|                      | count | total |
  //| uvm_top.parent.child |     1 |    1  |
  //| uvm_top.parent       |     0 |    0  |
  //| uvm_top              |     0 |    1  |
  ```

```systemverilog
  function void set_propagate_mode (bit prop_mode);
