---

new

* events 的 get 函数将会在 events 的联合数组中新建一条索引为”end”，类型为 uvm_event 的记录，并把这个 uvm_event 的实例返回。

* 调用[uvm_event:wait_on](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2020%3A%20uvm_event_base.md)，等待 uvm_event 中的成员变量 on 变为 1(uvm_event:trigger)。trigger 会让 on 值变为 1，也就是说只要某个进程触发了 end_event 的 trigger 事件，那么就会释放这个 wait_on 进程。这个变量在 [uvm_reg_map:do_write]() 中进行等待，在 [uvm_sequence_base:finish_item](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2001%3A%20uvm_sequence_base.md) 中传递，在 [uvm_component:end_tr](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2006%3A%20uvm_component.md) 中触发

