get_ints

* Purpose: Converts packed bits to integers.
* Operation: Creates an int array and fills it with packed data, handling endianness.
* Key feature: Provides packed data in integer format.

```systemverilog
function void uvm_packer::get_ints(ref int unsigned ints[]);
  int sz, v;
  sz = (m_packed_size+31) / 32;
  ints = new[sz];
  for (int i=0;i<sz;i++) begin
    if (i != sz-1 || (m_packed_size % 32) == 0) 
      v = m_bits[ i*32 +: 32 ];
    else
      v = m_bits[ i*32 +: 32 ] & ('hFFFFFFFF >> (32-(m_packed_size%32)));
    if(big_endian) begin
      int tmp; tmp = v;
      for(int j=0; j<32; ++j) v[j] = tmp[31-j];
    end
    ints[i] = v;
  end
endfunction
