put_ints

* Purpose: Stores an integer stream into the packer.
* Operation: Converts integers to bits and stores in m_bits, handling endianness.
* Key feature: Allows input of integer data for packing.

```systemverilog
function void uvm_packer::put_ints (ref int unsigned intstream []);

  int int_size;
  int index;
  int unsigned v;

  int_size = intstream.size();

  index = 0;
  for (int i=0;i<int_size;i++) begin
    v = intstream[i];
    if(big_endian) begin
      int unsigned tv; tv = v;
      for(int j=0;j<32;++j) v[j] = tv[31-j];
    end
