wait_for_relevant

* 调用 [is_relevant]() 表示当前sequence是否可以参与仲裁，默认返回值为1，我们可以在sequence中重载这个函数，决定sequence被执行的时机。若所有的sequence的返回值都是0，sequencer会调用这个函数来等待sequence再次有效。我们在重载 is_relevant 时可以同时重载wait_for_relevant来决定sequence再次有效的时机。

* 在 [uvm_sequencer_base:m_wait_for_available_sequence](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05:%20uvm_seq/chapter%2003:%20uvm_sequencer_base.md) 中使用

```systemverilog
  virtual task wait_for_relevant();
    event e;
    wait_rel_default = 1;
    if (is_rel_default != wait_rel_default)
      uvm_report_fatal("RELMSM", 
        "is_relevant() was implemented without defining wait_for_relevant()", UVM_NONE);
    @e;  // this is intended to never return
  endtask
```


