---

kill

* 直接调用这个方法可以终止 sequence 的执行
* 结束前先检查 sequence 是否已经挂载到了 sequencer 上

  * 如果没有挂载: 只需要调用 [m_kill]() 将 sequence 设置成结束状态并 kill 掉对应线程就可以
  * 如果挂载: 需要先调用 [uvm_sequencer_base:kill_sequence](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05:%20uvm_seq/chapter%2003:%20uvm_sequencer_base.md#kill_sequence) 先调用 remove_sequence_from_queues 将这个 sequence 发起的所有仲裁请求删除，再调用 [m_kill]() 重置这个 sequence 的状态并结束线程

```systemverilog
  function void kill();
    if (m_sequence_process != null) begin
      // If we are not connected to a sequencer, then issue
      // kill locally.
      if (m_sequencer == null) begin
        m_kill();
        // We need to drop the objection if we raised it...
        if (get_automatic_phase_objection()) begin
           m_safe_drop_starting_phase("automatic phase objection");
        end
        return;
      end
      // If we are attached to a sequencer, then the sequencer
      // will clear out queues, and then kill this sequence
      m_sequencer.kill_sequence(this);
      // We need to drop the objection if we raised it...
      if (get_automatic_phase_objection()) begin
         m_safe_drop_starting_phase("automatic phase objection");
      end
      return;
    end
  endfunction
```

