start_item

```systemverilog
//|   sequencer.wait_for_grant(prior) (task) \ start_item  \
//|   parent_seq.pre_do(1)            (task) /              \
//|                                                      `uvm_do* macros
//|   parent_seq.mid_do(item)         (func) \              /
//|   sequencer.send_request(item)    (func)  \finish_item /
//|   sequencer.wait_for_item_done()  (task)  /
//|   parent_seq.post_do(item)        (func) /
```
* 判断传入 start_item 的参数是否为一个 sequence 。只有是 sequence_item 才能作为参数传入 start_item 中。

* 通过三个参数来分别指定要执行的uvm_sequence_item类型的对象，priority和sequencer，若传入的sequence_item对象句柄为null，或者该对象句柄指向的是一个uvm_sequence_base对象(即是一个sequence)则报错返回。
* 若传入sequencer参数为null，则调用 [uvm_sequence_item:get_sequencer](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2002%3A%20uvm_sequence_item.md) 拿到sequence_item或者是当前sequence的m_sequencer，若均为null，则报错返回。

* 接着调用 [uvm_sequence_item:set_item_context](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2002%3A%20uvm_sequence_item.md) 传入this指针将当前的sequence设置为该sequence_item的parent sequence，将刚才拿到的m_sequencer句柄设置为它的m_sequencer。这里对信息的设置其实在用宏创建的时候已经在 [create_item]() 中完成过一次

* 若没有设置priority参数或者传入的priority值小于0，则调用 [get_priority]() 拿到当前sequence的m_priority，然后作为第二个参数调用m_sequencer的wait_for_grant

* 调用 [uvm_sequencer_base:wait_for_grant](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2003%3A%20uvm_sequencer_base.md) sequencer中有一套仲裁机制，来决定sequence的执行顺序，这个函数返回以后，最后调用callback pre_do，**对于 sequence 的仲裁是由 sequence item 发起的，因此不会出现 sequence 获得了使用权但是没有 sequence item 的情况**

```systemverilog
virtual task start_item (uvm_sequence_item item,
                         int set_priority = -1,
                         uvm_sequencer_base sequencer=null);
  uvm_sequence_base seq;

  // Check if the item is null
  if(item == null) begin
    uvm_report_fatal("NULLITM",
       {"attempting to start a null item from sequence '",
        get_full_name(), "'"}, UVM_NONE);
    return;
  end

  // Check if the item is actually a sequence (which is not allowed)
  if($cast(seq, item)) begin
    uvm_report_fatal("SEQNOTITM",
       {"attempting to start a sequence using start_item() from sequence '",
        get_full_name(), "'. Use seq.start() instead."}, UVM_NONE);
    return;
  end

  // 在 set_item_context 中为 sequence 和 sequence_item 都绑定了 sequencer
  // If no sequencer is provided, try to get it from the item
  if (sequencer == null)
      sequencer = item.get_sequencer();

  // If still null, try to get the sequencer from this sequence
  if(sequencer == null)
      sequencer = get_sequencer();   

  // If still null, report an error
  if(sequencer == null) begin
      uvm_report_fatal("SEQ",{"neither the item's sequencer nor dedicated sequencer has been supplied to 
                               start item in ",get_full_name()},UVM_NONE);
     return;
  end

  // Set the context for the item
  item.set_item_context(this, sequencer);

  // If priority is not set, get the default priority
  if (set_priority < 0)
    set_priority = get_priority();

  // Wait for the sequencer to grant permission to send the item
  sequencer.wait_for_grant(this, set_priority);

  // If auto item recording is enabled, begin a child transaction
  if (sequencer.is_auto_item_recording_enabled()) begin
    void'(sequencer.begin_child_tr(item, 
                                   (m_tr_recorder == null) ? 0 : m_tr_recorder.get_handle(), 
                                   item.get_root_sequence_name(), "Transactions"));
  end

  // Call pre_do before finishing
  pre_do(1);

endtask  
```

