finish_item

* 调用[uvm_sequencer_param_base:send_request](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2006%3A%20uvm_sequencer_param_base.md)

* 这个函数的调用说明当前的 sequence 已经获取到了 sequencer 的使用权，否则会在 [uvm_sequencer_base:wait_for_grant](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2003%3A%20uvm_sequencer_base.md) 中等待

* 调用 [uvm_sequencer_base:wait_for_item_done](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2003%3A%20uvm_sequencer_base.md#wait_for_item_done-1) 判断 driver 是否已经调用了 [uvm_sequencer:item_done](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2005%3A%20uvm_sequencer.md) 函数

* 调用 [uvm_component:end_tr](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2006%3A%20uvm_component.md)，其中调用 [uvm_transaction:end_event](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03:%20uvm_base/chapter%2055:%20uvm_transaction.md) 来表示一个操作在总线上完成了

```systemverilog
virtual task finish_item (uvm_sequence_item item,
                          int set_priority = -1);

  uvm_sequencer_base sequencer;

  sequencer = item.get_sequencer();

  if (sequencer == null) begin
      uvm_report_fatal("STRITM", "sequence_item has null sequencer", UVM_NONE);
  end

  mid_do(item);
  sequencer.send_request(this, item);

  // released by item_done
  sequencer.wait_for_item_done(this, -1);

  if (sequencer.is_auto_item_recording_enabled()) begin
    sequencer.end_tr(item);
  end

  post_do(item);

endtask
```

