get_base_response

![image](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/assets/66343787/33a787d8-a92b-4fb1-b593-1da58c4819dc)

* 它存放的内容是 uvm_sequence_item 类型
```systemverilog
protected uvm_sequence_item response_queue[$];
```
* 被[uvm_sequence:get_response](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2007%3A%20uvm_sequence.md)调用

* 若当前response_queue队列中没有response，则先等待直到有response被放入该队列。通过第二个参数transaction_id可以拿到与之相对于的response，若参数为默认值-1，则从response_queue 最前面取出一个response并返回。若指定了参数transaction_id不为-1，则每次response_queue有更新，就遍历该队列找到与之匹配的response并将其从队列中删除。

* 将所有的 response item 中的信息复制到 response 中并返回, **response 的来源有两种，一种是通过 item_done 作为参数传来，另外一种是直接通过 driver 的 rsp_port 传来**
```systemverilog
virtual task get_base_response(output uvm_sequence_item response, input int transaction_id = -1);

  int queue_size, i;

  if (response_queue.size() == 0)
    wait (response_queue.size() != 0);

  if (transaction_id == -1) begin
    response = response_queue.pop_front();
    return;
  end

  forever begin
    queue_size = response_queue.size();
    for (i = 0; i < queue_size; i++) begin
      if (response_queue[i].get_transaction_id() == transaction_id) 
        begin
          $cast(response,response_queue[i]);
          response_queue.delete(i);
          return;
        end
    end
    wait (response_queue.size() != queue_size);
  end
endtask
```

