wait_for_item_done

* 被 [uvm_sequence_base:finish_item](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2001%3A%20uvm_sequence_base.md#finish_item) 调用
* 把两个变量 `m_wait_for_item_sequence_id` 和 `m_wait_for_item_transaction_id` 分别置为-1，然后等待 `sequence_id` 和 `transaction_id` 的值被复位为-1，实际上是在等待 [item_done]() 被调用

```systemverilog
task uvm_sequencer_base::wait_for_item_done(uvm_sequence_base sequence_ptr,
                                            int transaction_id);
  int sequence_id;

  sequence_id = sequence_ptr.m_get_sqr_sequence_id(m_sequencer_id, 1);
  m_wait_for_item_sequence_id = -1;
  m_wait_for_item_transaction_id = -1;

  if (transaction_id == -1)
    wait (m_wait_for_item_sequence_id == sequence_id);
  else
    wait ((m_wait_for_item_sequence_id == sequence_id &&
           m_wait_for_item_transaction_id == transaction_id));
endtask
