get_next_item

* 其中的bit类型变量sequence_item_requested和get_next_item_called在每次调用之后都会被置为1，在 [item_done]() 被调用时会把它们清零，防止在 item_done 被调用之前多次调用get_next_item 引发问题。

```systemverilog
bit sequence_item_requested;
bit get_next_item_called;
```

* 这其中最关键的就是调用 调用[uvm_sequencer_base:m_select_sequence](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2003%3A%20uvm_sequencer_base.md) 任务，在这个任务中会真正进行所有request的仲裁工作。最后从m_req_fifo中试图拿到一笔sequence_item，这是一个定义在uvm_sequencer_param_base #()中的uvm_tlm_fifo #(REQ)类型接口，sequence_item就是通过这个接口来传输。

* 这个函数的最后在 `m_req_fifo` 中获取到了 sequence_item，这个 sequence_item 是当sequence获取了sequencer 的使用权后，在 [uvm_sequencer_param_base:send_request](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2006%3A%20uvm_sequencer_param_base.md) 中放入的

* **最后获得 sequence_item 调用的是 peek 函数，说明其本身并没有从队列中删除，真正的 get 在 [item_done]() 中调用，peek 会一直等待，直到获取到了 item，这说明只有真正消耗掉这个 item 之后才会从队列中移出**

  <img width="700" alt="image" src="https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/assets/66343787/1cf24490-ebb1-4a47-9a4f-de85143c3c6f"> 

```systemverilog
task uvm_sequencer::get_next_item(output REQ t);
  REQ req_item;

  // If a sequence_item has already been requested, then get_next_item()
  // should not be called again until item_done() has been called.

  if (get_next_item_called == 1)
    uvm_report_error(get_full_name(),
      "Get_next_item called twice without item_done or get in between", UVM_NONE);

  if (!sequence_item_requested)
    m_select_sequence();

  // Set flag indicating that the item has been requested to ensure that item_done or get
  // is called between requests
  sequence_item_requested = 1;
  get_next_item_called = 1;

  // request is put by finish_item
  m_req_fifo.peek(t);
endtask
```

---

try_next_item

* 调用这个函数时候，会绕开 [uvm_sequencer_base:m_select_sequence](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2003%3A%20uvm_sequencer_base.md)，因为这个函数是不耗时的，所以需要跳过等待的逻辑。
* 直接调用 [uvm_sequencer_base:m_choose_next_request](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05:%20uvm_seq/chapter%2003:%20uvm_sequencer_base.md#m_choose_next_request)，如果获取不到可以使用的 sequence 就直接返回，如果获取到就立即尝试获得 sequence item，如果获取不到就会报错。

  <img width="700" alt="image" src="https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/assets/66343787/e868b959-52be-4912-b189-236c2420126a"> 

```systemverilog
task uvm_sequencer::try_next_item(output REQ t);
  int selected_sequence;
  time arb_time;
  uvm_sequence_base seq;

  if (get_next_item_called == 1) begin
    uvm_report_error(get_full_name(), "get_next_item/try_next_item called twice without item_done or get in between", UVM_NONE);
    return;
  end

  // allow state from last transaction to settle such that sequences'
  // relevancy can be determined with up-to-date information
  wait_for_sequences();

  // choose the sequence based on relevancy
  selected_sequence = m_choose_next_request();

  // return if none available
  if (selected_sequence == -1) begin
    t = null;
    return;
  end

  // ======================================================== //
  // 如果有可以使用的 sequence，因为 sequence 的 arbitration 实际上  //
  // 是 sequence_item 之间的 arbitration，因此这里可以保证获取到     //
  // sequence_item，如果后面获取不到就需要报错，但是如果单纯没有可以使用  //
  // sequence 则在前面直接返回，不会在这里报错                       //
  // ======================================================== //

  // now, allow chosen sequence to resume
  m_set_arbitration_completed(arb_sequence_q[selected_sequence].request_id);
  seq = arb_sequence_q[selected_sequence].sequence_ptr;
  arb_sequence_q.delete(selected_sequence);
  m_update_lists();
  sequence_item_requested = 1;
  get_next_item_called = 1;

  // give it one NBA to put a new item in the fifo
  wait_for_sequences();

  // attempt to get the item; if it fails, produce an error and return
  if (!m_req_fifo.try_peek(t))
    uvm_report_error("TRY_NEXT_BLOCKED", {"try_next_item: the selected sequence '",
      seq.get_full_name(), "' did not produce an item within an NBA delay. ",
      "Sequences should not consume time between calls to start_item and finish_item. ",
      "Returning null item."}, UVM_NONE);

endtask
```
