peek

* 被 [uvm_reg_sequence:body]() 调用，从sequence发送给driver的request item queue 中获取一个item，但是不从queue中删除

```systemverilog
task uvm_sequencer::peek(output REQ t);

  if (sequence_item_requested == 0) begin
    m_select_sequence();
  end

  // Set flag indicating that the item has been requested to ensure that item_done or get
  // is called between requests
  sequence_item_requested = 1;
  m_req_fifo.peek(t);
endtask
```

