put_response

![image](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/assets/66343787/dd8ce8b4-9ae5-4601-80cd-32f5a20094ea)

* 这个函数是 [seq_item_export(uvm_seq_item_pull_imp)]() 中函数的具体实现，由于这个端口是 imp，所以要在当前的 class 中实现对应的方法

* 被 [uvm_sequencer:item_done](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2005%3A%20uvm_sequencer.md) 调用，也可以在 driver 里面被直接调用，这样可以多次添加 response item

* 调用 [m_last_rsp_push_front]()，这个跟之前的 [m_last_req_push_front]() 函数类似，把最后发送的response存放在RSP类型的队列m_last_rsp_buffer中。

* 用int型变量m_num_rsps_received记录发送的response数量。
* 接着检查参数item的sequence_id是否为-1，若是(说明在driver中调用item_done()之前没有调用 [uvm_sequence_item:set_id_info](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05:%20uvm_seq/chapter%2002:%20uvm_sequence_item.md) / [uvm_sequence_item:set_sequence_id](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05:%20uvm_seq/chapter%2002:%20uvm_sequence_item.md) 为response设置相关信息)，函数直接返回。

* 调用[uvm_sequencer_base:m_find_sequence](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/c5d8b77aed0e8f6a8863d1464436625c0bb8a2d8/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2003%3A%20uvm_sequencer_base.md) 获取当前 sequence_item 的 sequence

* 接下来若sequence的 [get_use_response_handler]()返回1，则直接调用 [response_handler]() 并返回，否则，调用 [uvm_sequence:put_response](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2007%3A%20uvm_sequence.md)，**这说明不同的 response item 会被放到对应的 sequence 中存储，而不是保存到一起**

* 如果通过重载 [get_use_response_handler]() 设置了返回 1，那么同时必须要重载 [response_handler]()，在重载的实现里面处理 response item，如果没有处理，则会造成死锁

```systemverilog
function void uvm_sequencer_param_base::put_response (RSP t);
  uvm_sequence_base sequence_ptr;

  if (t == null) begin
    uvm_report_fatal("SQRPUT", "Driver put a null response", UVM_NONE);
  end

  // save the response item into the queue
  m_last_rsp_push_front(t);
  m_num_rsps_received++;

  // Check that set_id_info was called
  if (t.get_sequence_id() == -1) begin
`ifndef CDNS_NO_SQR_CHK_SEQ_ID
    uvm_report_fatal("SQRPUT", "Driver put a response with null sequence_id", UVM_NONE);
`endif
    return;
  end

  // 根据 sequence_id 找到对应的 sequence, 每一个 sequence 在不同的 sequencer 中都有自己的 sequence_id
  sequence_ptr = m_find_sequence(t.get_sequence_id());

  if (sequence_ptr != null) begin
    // If the response_handler is enabled for this sequence, then call the response handler
    if (sequence_ptr.get_use_response_handler() == 1) begin
      sequence_ptr.response_handler(t);
      return;
    end

    sequence_ptr.put_response(t);
  end
  else begin
    uvm_report_info("Sequencer", 
                    $sformatf("Dropping response for sequence %0d, sequence not found.  
                               Probable cause: sequence exited or has been killed", 
                               t.get_sequence_id()));
  end
endfunction
```
