send_request

* 被[uvm_sequence_base:finish_item](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2006%3A%20uvm_sequencer_param_base.md)调用，这时当前的 sequence 已经获取到了 sequencer 的使用权，**传入的类型是 sequence_item，在发送之前需要向下转型，转换成自定义的 sequence item 类型**

* 首先检查m_wait_for_grant_semaphore是否为0，这个变量就是保证在每次调用之前已经调用过[uvm_sequencer_base:wait_for_grant](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2003%3A%20uvm_sequencer_base.md)，在每次执行wait_for_grant()时相应request被仲裁之后加1，之后才能调用[uvm_sequencer_base:wait_for_grant](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2003%3A%20uvm_sequencer_base.md)并在其中将变量的值减1。

* 若函数第三个参数rerandomize为1，则对sequence_item做随机化操作。这里之所以要重新随机化，是因为若直接对uvm_sequence_item类型的t随机化时，我们真正要发送的继承自uvm_sequence_item 类型的REQ类型中的某些变量是不会做随机化的。

* 接着调用 [uvm_transaction:get_transaction_id](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2055%3A%20uvm_transaction.md) 拿到sequence_item的m_transaction_id，若其为默认值-1，则把当前sequence中的变量m_next_transaction_id值加1作为参数调用  [uvm_transaction:set_transaction_id](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2055%3A%20uvm_transaction.md) 赋值给m_transaction_id。

* integer类型变量m_transaction_id定义在 [uvm_transaction](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2055%3A%20uvm_transaction.md) 类中，代表每一笔transaction的id。

```systemverilog
local integer m_transaction_id = -1;
```

* int型变量m_next_transaction_id定义在 [uvm_sequence_base](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2001%3A%20uvm_sequence_base.md) 类中，用来记录当前sequence要发送的transaction的m_transaction_id。

```systemverilog
int   m_next_transaction_id = 1;
```

* 调用 [uvm_sequence_item:set_sequence_id](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2002%3A%20uvm_sequence_item.md) 来设置这个 sequence item 的 m_sequencer

* 调用 [m_last_req_push_front]()，把要发送的这个sequence_item 放入队列 m_last_req_buffer

* 设置好要发送 sequence_item 的sequence_id，调用try_put()向 m_req_fifo 中放入要发送的 sequence_item，sequencer 的 [uvm_sequencer:get_next_item](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05:%20uvm_seq/chapter%2005:%20uvm_sequencer.md) 会从中取走它交在driver。接下来int型变量m_num_reqs_sent的值加1，用来记录当前发送了多少个sequence_item，最后调用 [uvm_sequencer_base:grant_queued_locks](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2003%3A%20uvm_sequencer_base.md#grant_queued_locks)，尽快处理仲裁队列中出现的lock请求。

```systemverilog
uvm_tlm_fifo #(REQ) m_req_fifo;
```

```systemverilog
function void uvm_sequencer_param_base::send_request(uvm_sequence_base sequence_ptr,
                                                     uvm_sequence_item t,
                                                     bit rerandomize = 0);
  REQ param_t;

  if (sequence_ptr == null) begin
    uvm_report_fatal("SNDREQ", "Send request sequence_ptr is null", UVM_NONE);
  end

  //用来保证发送 item 的时候 sequence 已经获得了 sequencer 的使用权
  if (sequence_ptr.m_wait_for_grant_semaphore < 1) begin
    uvm_report_fatal("SNDREQ", "Send request called without wait_for_grant", UVM_NONE);
  end
  sequence_ptr.m_wait_for_grant_semaphore--;

  //先对类型进行转换，传入的类型是 sequence_item，需要向下转型，转换成自定义的 sequence item 类型
  if ($cast(param_t, t)) begin
    if (rerandomize == 1) begin
      if (!param_t.randomize()) begin
        uvm_report_warning("SQRSNDREQ", "Failed to rerandomize sequence item in send_request");
      end
    end
    if (param_t.get_transaction_id() == -1) begin
      //m_next_transaction_id 保存在 sequence 中，记录着由当前的 sequence 发出的 sequence_item 的 id
      param_t.set_transaction_id(sequence_ptr.m_next_transaction_id++);
    end

    //放入队列
    m_last_req_push_front(param_t);
  end else begin
    uvm_report_fatal(get_name(),$sformatf("send_request failed to cast sequence item"), UVM_NONE);
  end

  param_t.set_sequence_id(sequence_ptr.m_get_sqr_sequence_id(m_sequencer_id, 1));
  t.set_sequencer(this);

  // put it into the final request queue
  if (m_req_fifo.try_put(param_t) != 1) begin
    uvm_report_fatal(get_full_name(), "Concurrent calls to get_next_item() not supported. Consider using a semaphore to 
                                       ensure that concurrent processes take turns in the driver", UVM_NONE);
  end

  m_num_reqs_sent++;
  // Grant any locks as soon as possible
  grant_queued_locks();
endfunction
```
