run_phase

* 调用 [uvm_sequencer_base:m_select_sequence](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2003%3A%20uvm_sequencer_base.md) 先获取到下一个可以使用的 transaction
* 通过设置 id，释放等待的 [uvm_sequencer:item_done](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2005%3A%20uvm_sequencer.md) 方法

```systemverilog
task run_phase(uvm_phase phase);
  REQ t;
  int selected_sequence;

  fork
    super.run_phase(phase);
    forever
      begin
        m_select_sequence();
        m_req_fifo.get(t);
        req_port.put(t);
