```
---

new

* 传入了 0 和 UVM_UNBODUNDED_CONNECTIONS 两个参数，表示可以有任意个 IMP 来连接到此 port 上来。

```systemverilog
function new (string name, uvm_component parent);
  super.new (name, parent, UVM_PORT, 0, UVM_UNBOUNDED_CONNECTIONS);
  m_if_mask = `UVM_TLM_ANALYSIS_MASK;  
endfunction
```
---

write

* 重写了 write 函数。由于可以有任意个 IMP 连接到此 port 上来，这些 IMP 都存放在 m_imp_list 中，可以通过 [uvm_port_base:get_if](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/03%3A%20uvm_base/chapter%2029%3A%20uvm_port_base.md) 来取得所有的这些 IMP。

* 这里直接对函数进行了重写，并没有像一般port一样通过宏定义的方式重写，函数的原型在[uvm_tlm_if_base](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/10%3A%20uvm_tlm/chapter%2002%3A%20uvm_tlm_ifs.md)中

* **这个函数是 analysis port 功能的具体表现 - 遍历了所有连接的 imp，依次发送信息**
```systemverilog
function void write (input T t);
  uvm_tlm_if_base # (T, T) tif;
  for (int i = 0; i < this.size(); i++) begin
    tif = this.get_if (i);
    if ( tif == null )
      uvm_report_fatal ("NTCONN", {"No uvm_tlm interface is connected to ", get_full_name(), " 
                                    for executing write()"}, UVM_NONE);
    tif.write (t);
  end 
endfunction
```

