get

* get_ap 定义在 [uvm_tlm_fifo_base](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/10:%20uvm_tlm/chapter%2009:%20uvm_tlm_fifo_base.md) 中

```systemverilog
