uvm_reg_field

* UVM 的 register model 中最基本的存储数据的单位是 uvm_reg_field，它用来代表寄存器中的某几个域。

  <img width="600" alt="image" src="https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/assets/66343787/078277eb-0366-4d89-9831-07aaca020623">

* 定义了三个 [uvm_reg_model:uvm_reg_data_t](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/11%3A%20uvm_reg/chapter%2002%3A%20uvm_reg_model.md) 类型的变量 - `value`, `m_mirrored`, `m_desired`, 它本质上是 bit 类型，其宽度为 UVM_REG_DATA_WIDTH，这个宽度值是一个宏，其默认值为 64

* 每一个属性的含义:
   * m_access => 这个 reg_field 的存储特性
   * m_parent => 此 reg_field 所在的 uvm_reg 的指针
   * m_lsb => reg_field 的最低位在 uvm_reg 中的位置
   * m_size => 表示此 uvm_reg_field 占据了几个 bit
   * m_volatile => 表示此 uvm_reg_field 是否会被 DUT 主动修改
   * m_reset => 表示此 uvm_reg_field 复位后的值, 这里的 m_reset 是一个联合数组，表示一个寄存器可以有多个复位值，如硬复位，软复位等
   * m_individeally_accessible => 表示此 uvm_reg_field 是否可以进行 field 级别的读写操作，在 [is_indv_accessible]() 中作为判断条件

* general functions

  <img width="600" alt="image" src="https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/assets/66343787/a520bba3-288a-4019-94c0-135989673f59">

* m_reset [“HARD”]存储硬重置值(hard reset), m_reset是一种带有一种重置键的关联数组
* m_mirrored存储我们在待测试设计(DUT)中所认为应该存储的值
* m_desired存储我们想要设置给DUT的值
* value将要采样的值存储在功能覆盖率中，或者当该字段被随机化时将value约束

   | Aspect | value | m_mirrored | m_desired |
   |--------|---------|--------------|-------------|
   | Declaration | rand uvm_reg_data_t value; | local uvm_reg_data_t m_mirrored; | local uvm_reg_data_t m_desired; |
   | Accessibility | Public | Private (local) | Private (local) |
   | Purpose | Represents the field's value for randomization and functional coverage | Represents what we believe is in the hardware | Represents the desired value after a set() operation |
   | Updated when | After randomization | After read operations from DUT | After set() method calls |
   | Used in | Randomization constraints, functional coverage sampling | Comparing with DUT reads, predicting field values | Determining if an update to DUT is needed |
   | Randomizable | Yes | No | No |
   | Reflects | Intended value for verification | Current assumed hardware state | Desired hardware state |
   | In relation to DUT | May or may not match DUT | Should match DUT if in sync | May differ from DUT until updated |
   | Role in UVM Reg Model | Drives stimulus generation | Maintains mirror of hardware state | Tracks desired changes before update |

* 当寄存器随机化后，期望值会被随机，但是镜像值不变，之后调用update任务，可以更新DUT中的寄存器值。但是一个field能够被随机化，需要:
  * 在filed的configure第八个参数设为1.
  * filed为rand类型。
  * filed的读写类型为可写的。

* 寄存器模型中的寄存器值应该与DUT保持同步，但是由于DUT的值是实时更新的，所以寄存器模型并不能实时知道这种更新，在寄存器模型中专门有个值来尽可能与DUT中寄存器的值保持一致，叫镜像值(mirrorred value)。寄存器模型中还有一个值叫期望值(desired value)，这个值保存我们希望写入寄存器的值。比如希望向DUT某个寄存器写入'h1，用set函数设置期望值，然后用update任务(update会比较镜像值和期望值，如果不一样，将期望值写入DUT，并更新镜像值)。

```systemverilog
class uvm_reg_field extends uvm_object;

   // Variable: value
   // Mirrored field value.
   // This value can be sampled in a functional coverage model
   // or constrained when randomized.
   rand  uvm_reg_data_t  value; // Mirrored after randomize()

   local uvm_reg_data_t  m_mirrored; // What we think is in the HW
   local uvm_reg_data_t  m_desired;  // Mirrored after set()
   local string          m_access;
   local uvm_reg         m_parent;
   local int unsigned    m_lsb;
   local int unsigned    m_size;
   local bit             m_volatile;
   local uvm_reg_data_t  m_reset[string];
   local bit             m_written;
   local bit             m_read_in_progress;
   local bit             m_write_in_progress;
   local string          m_fname;
   local int             m_lineno;
   local int             m_cover_on;
   local bit             m_individually_accessible;
   local uvm_check_e     m_check;

   local static int m_max_size;
   local static bit m_policy_names[string];

   constraint uvm_reg_field_valid {
      if (`UVM_REG_DATA_WIDTH > m_size) {
         value < (`UVM_REG_DATA_WIDTH'h1 << m_size);
      }
   }

   function uvm_reg_field::new(string name = "uvm_reg_field");
      super.new(name);
   endfunction: new
```


```
// Read-only policies:
"RO"  - Read-only, writes have no effect
"RC"  - Read clears all bits
"RS"  - Read sets all bits

// Write-only policies:  
"WO"  - Write-only, reads return error
"WOC" - Write-only, writes clear all bits
"WOS" - Write-only, writes set all bits

// Read-write policies:
"RW"  - Standard read-write 
"WRC" - Write as-is, read clears all bits
"WRS" - Write as-is, read sets all bits

// Write-1/Write-0 policies:
"W1C" - Write 1 to clear bits
"W1S" - Write 1 to set bits  
"W1T" - Write 1 to toggle bits
"W0C" - Write 0 to clear bits
"W0S" - Write 0 to set bits
"W0T" - Write 0 to toggle bits

// Combination policies:
"WSRC" - Write sets all bits, read clears all bits
"WCRS" - Write clears all bits, read sets all bits
"W1SRC" - Write 1 sets bits, read clears all bits
"W1CRS" - Write 1 clears bits, read sets all bits
"W0SRC" - Write 0 sets bits, read clears all bits  
"W0CRS" - Write 0 clears bits, read sets all bits

// Special policies:
"W1"  - First write after reset is as-is, subsequent writes have no effect
"WO1" - Like W1 but read returns error
"NOACCESS" - No read or write access allowed
```

---

configure

* 在将 uvm_field 加入到 uvm_reg 中调用，先对 uvm_field 进行实例化，之后调用这个函数，这个函数把相关成员变量赋值，另外它还调用了 uvm_reg 的 add_field 函数，把此 field 加入到了 uvm_reg 的 m_fields 数组中。

* m_max_size 也是一个静态的变量，它表示整个 register model 中最大的 uvm_reg_field 的位宽。
```systemverilog
local static int m_max_size;
```
* 在没有 reset 情况下，会向 uvm_resource_pool 中写入一条记录，表明此 uvm_reg_field 没有 reset，如果有 reset 则会调用 [set_reset]()

* 调用[uvm_reg:add_field](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/11:%20uvm_reg/chapter%2003:%20uvm_reg.md), m_parent 指的就是此 uvm_reg_field 所在的 uvm_reg，将当前的这个 field 加入到的 register 当中，加入的时候会做一系列的检查

* 设置此 uvm_reg_field 是否可以进行随机化。

```systemverilog
function void uvm_reg_field::configure(uvm_reg        parent,
                                       int unsigned   size,
                                       int unsigned   lsb_pos,
                                       string         access,
                                       bit            volatile,
                                       uvm_reg_data_t reset,
                                       bit            has_reset,
                                       bit            is_rand,
                                       bit            individually_accessible); 
   m_parent = parent;
   if (size == 0) begin
      `uvm_error("RegModel",
         $sformatf("Field \"%s\" cannot have 0 bits", get_full_name()));
      size = 1;
   end

   m_size      = size;                                   // Set the size of the field
   m_volatile  = volatile;                               // Set whether the field is volatile
   m_access    = access.toupper();                       // Set the access policy (converted to uppercase)
   m_lsb       = lsb_pos;                                // Set the least significant bit position
   m_cover_on  = UVM_NO_COVERAGE;                        // Initialize coverage to off
   m_written   = 0;                                      // Initialize the written flag
   m_check     = volatile ? UVM_NO_CHECK : UVM_CHECK;    // Set check mode based on volatility
   m_individually_accessible = individually_accessible;  // Set individual accessibility

   if (has_reset)
      set_reset(reset);
   else
      uvm_resource_db#(bit)::set({"REG::", get_full_name()},
                                 "NO_REG_HW_RESET_TEST", 1);

   m_parent.add_field(this);

   if (!m_policy_names.exists(m_access)) begin
      `uvm_error("RegModel", {"Access policy '",access,
       "' for field '",get_full_name(),"' is not defined. Setting to RW"})
      m_access = "RW";
   end

   if (size > m_max_size)
      m_max_size = size;

   // Ignore is_rand if the field is known not to be writeable
   // i.e. not "RW", "WRC", "WRS", "WO", "W1", "WO1"
   case (access)
    "RO", "RC", "RS", "WC", "WS",
      "W1C", "W1S", "W1T", "W0C", "W0S", "W0T",
      "W1SRC", "W1CRS", "W0SRC", "W0CRS", "WSRC", "WCRS",
      "WOC", "WOS": is_rand = 0;
   endcase

   if (!is_rand)
     value.rand_mode(0);

endfunction: configure
```

