set_reset

* 调用 [configure]() 如果传入 reset=1 会调用这个函数

  <img width="550" alt="image" src="https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/66343787/182062400-e1211daf-3ae5-41f8-b57e-991ce0c95b4f.png">

* 在 m_reset 联合数组中插入一条记录，记录的索引是“HARD”
```systemverilog
function void uvm_reg_field::set_reset(uvm_reg_data_t value,
                                       string kind = "HARD");
   // ((1<<m_size) - 1): This creates a bit mask to ensure the reset value doesn't exceed the field's size.
   m_reset[kind] = value & ((1<<m_size) - 1);
endfunction: set_reset
```


