reset

* 被[uvm_reg:reset](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/edit/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/11%3A%20uvm_reg/chapter%2003%3A%20uvm_reg.md)调用

  <img width="550" alt="image" src="https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/66343787/182062425-6d228e3b-efab-4649-9db3-2acd921e431e.png">

* 检查是否定义了名字为”HARD”的复位，如果没有定义，则直接返回。
* 把 uvm_reg_field 内部三个用于存储数据的变量全部赋值为 m_reset 中的相应值。
```systemverilog
function void uvm_reg_field::reset(string kind = "HARD");

   if (!m_reset.exists(kind))
      return;

   m_mirrored = m_reset[kind];
   m_desired  = m_mirrored;
   value      = m_mirrored;

   if (kind == "HARD")
      m_written  = 0;

endfunction: reset
```

---

predict

* This function is often used in testbenches to update the register model when the hardware is expected to change without a direct write operation.
```systemverilog
function bit uvm_reg_field::predict (uvm_reg_data_t    value,
                                     uvm_reg_byte_en_t be = -1,
                                     uvm_predict_e     kind = UVM_PREDICT_DIRECT,
                                     uvm_path_e        path = UVM_FRONTDOOR,
                                     uvm_reg_map       map = null,
                                     string            fname = "",
                                     int               lineno = 0);
  uvm_reg_item rw = new;
  rw.value[0] = value;
  rw.path = path;
  rw.map = map;
  rw.fname = fname;
  rw.lineno = lineno;
  do_predict(rw, kind, be);
  predict = (rw.status == UVM_NOT_OK) ? 0 : 1;
endfunction: predict
```

---

do_predict

* 使用这个函数，根据 read 或者 write 操作，来更新寄存器模型中的值
* 使用 [uvm_reg_model:uvm_reg_byte_en_t](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/11%3A%20uvm_reg/chapter%2002%3A%20uvm_reg_model.md) 类型的参数，默认的参数值是-1，但是这个类型是无符号类型，则表示最终的值为全1。进入函数时先检查当前 byte 是否打开 predict 功能，如果没有则直接返回。UVM_REG_DATA_WIDTH 为 64，共有 8 个 byte，所以 UVM_REG_BYTENABLE_WIDTH 的值为 8，分别控制 8 个 byte 的使能。be 位主要是控制寄存器中某个 byte 是否进行 predict

```systemverilog
typedef  bit unsigned [`UVM_REG_BYTENABLE_WIDTH-1:0]  uvm_reg_byte_en_t ;
```

* UVM_PREDICT_WRITE
  * 被 [uvm_reg:do_predict](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/11:%20uvm_reg/chapter%2003:%20uvm_reg.md) 调用
  * 调用 [XpredictX]() 根据不同的存储策略返回操作后的寄存器的值
  * 根据此 uvm_reg_field 的有效位数，把 field_val 中的无效位去除

* UVM_PREDICT_READ
  * 被 [uvm_reg:do_read](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/11:%20uvm_reg/chapter%2003:%20uvm_reg.md) 调用
  * 对于读清的，置为 0，对于读置位的，置为全 1，对于只写的，则不做任何处理。把 uvm_reg_field 中三个存储数据的变量的值更新。

* 将所有存放数据的变量值更新成刚刚预测过的值

```systemverilog
function void uvm_reg_field::do_predict(uvm_reg_item      rw,
                                        uvm_predict_e     kind = UVM_PREDICT_DIRECT,
                                        uvm_reg_byte_en_t be = -1);

   // 对于写操作是将要写入的数，对于读操作是读出来的值
   uvm_reg_data_t field_val = rw.value[0] & ((1 << m_size)-1);

   if (rw.status != UVM_NOT_OK)
     rw.status = UVM_IS_OK;

   // Check if prediction is enabled for this byte
   if (!be[0])
     return;

   m_fname = rw.fname;
   m_lineno = rw.lineno;

   case (kind)

     UVM_PREDICT_WRITE:
       begin
         uvm_reg_field_cb_iter cbs = new(this);

         // For frontdoor or predict access, use XpredictX to determine final value
         if (rw.path == UVM_FRONTDOOR || rw.path == UVM_PREDICT)
            field_val = XpredictX(m_mirrored,   // Current register value
                                  field_val,    // Value to be written
                                  rw.map);

         m_written = 1;

         // Execute post-predict callbacks
         for (uvm_reg_cbs cb = cbs.first(); cb != null; cb = cbs.next())
            cb.post_predict(this, m_mirrored, field_val, 
                            UVM_PREDICT_WRITE, rw.path, rw.map);

         // Ensure field value doesn't exceed field size
         field_val &= ('b1 << m_size)-1;

       end

     UVM_PREDICT_READ:
       begin
         uvm_reg_field_cb_iter cbs = new(this);

         if (rw.path == UVM_FRONTDOOR || rw.path == UVM_PREDICT) begin

            string acc = get_access(rw.map);

            // Handle special read behaviors
            if (acc == "RC" ||
                acc == "WRC" ||
                acc == "WSRC" ||
                acc == "W1SRC" ||
                acc == "W0SRC")
              field_val = 0;  // Clear on read

            else if (acc == "RS" ||
                     acc == "WRS" ||
                     acc == "WCRS" ||
                     acc == "W1CRS" ||
                     acc == "W0CRS")
              field_val = ('b1 << m_size)-1; // Set on read

            else if (acc == "WO" ||
                     acc == "WOC" ||
                     acc == "WOS" ||
                     acc == "WO1" ||
                     acc == "NOACCESS")
              return; // No read access
         end

         // Execute post-predict callbacks
         for (uvm_reg_cbs cb = cbs.first(); cb != null; cb = cbs.next())
            cb.post_predict(this, m_mirrored, field_val,
                            UVM_PREDICT_READ, rw.path, rw.map);

         // Ensure field value doesn't exceed field size
         field_val &= ('b1 << m_size)-1;

       end

     UVM_PREDICT_DIRECT:
       begin
         // Check if register is busy during direct prediction
         if (m_parent.is_busy()) begin
           `uvm_warning("RegModel", {"Trying to predict value of field '",
              get_name(),"' while register '",m_parent.get_full_name(),
              "' is being accessed"})
           rw.status = UVM_NOT_OK;
         end
       end
   endcase

   // Update the mirrored, desired, and current values with the predicted value
   m_mirrored = field_val;
   m_desired  = field_val;
   this.value = field_val;

endfunction: do_predict
```

---

XpredictX

* 被 [do_predict]() 调用，返回需要写入到寄存器模型中的真实值
* 被 [uvm_reg:do_write](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/11%3A%20uvm_reg/chapter%2003%3A%20uvm_reg.md) 调用，在使用后门写入之前根据寄存器的读写规则来更新要从后面写入的值

* 根据此 uvm_reg_field 的存取策略，来返回写操作后寄存器中的数值。

  <img width="550" alt="image" src="https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/assets/66343787/55d97694-b6cf-4d54-89b8-ffb07e57e89d">

```systemverilog
function uvm_reg_data_t uvm_reg_field::XpredictX (uvm_reg_data_t cur_val,
                                                  uvm_reg_data_t wr_val,
                                                  uvm_reg_map    map);
   uvm_reg_data_t mask = ('b1 << m_size)-1;

   case (get_access(map))
     "RO":    return cur_val;
     "RW":    return wr_val;
     "RC":    return cur_val;
     "RS":    return cur_val;
     "WC":    return '0;
     "WS":    return mask;
     "WRC":   return wr_val;
     "WRS":   return wr_val;
     "WSRC":  return mask;
     "WCRS":  return '0;
     "W1C":   return cur_val & (~wr_val);
     "W1S":   return cur_val | wr_val;
     "W1T":   return cur_val ^ wr_val;
     "W0C":   return cur_val & wr_val;
     "W0S":   return cur_val | (~wr_val & mask);
     "W0T":   return cur_val ^ (~wr_val & mask);
     "W1SRC": return cur_val | wr_val;
     "W1CRS": return cur_val & (~wr_val);
     "W0SRC": return cur_val | (~wr_val & mask);
     "W0CRS": return cur_val & wr_val;
     "WO":    return wr_val;
     "WOC":   return '0;
     "WOS":   return mask;
     "W1":    return (m_written) ? cur_val : wr_val;
     "WO1":   return (m_written) ? cur_val : wr_val;
     "NOACCESS": return cur_val;
     default: return wr_val;
   endcase

   `uvm_fatal("RegModel", "uvm_reg_field::XpredictX(): Internal error");
   return 0;
endfunction: XpredictX
```
---

write

* **uvm_reg_field 的 write 操作只能以 FRONTDOOR 方式进行， BACKDOOR 方式是不支持的**

* 函数的内容与 [uvm_reg:write](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/11:%20uvm_reg/chapter%2003:%20uvm_reg.md) 类似，这里需要注意的是把 element_kind 设置为 UVM_FIELD，表明这是由一个 uvm_reg_field 发起的写操作。

```systemverilog
task uvm_reg_field::write(output uvm_status_e       status,
                          input  uvm_reg_data_t     value,
                          input  uvm_path_e         path = UVM_DEFAULT_PATH,
                          input  uvm_reg_map        map = null,
                          input  uvm_sequence_base  parent = null,
                          input  int                prior = -1,
                          input  uvm_object         extension = null,
                          input  string             fname = "",
                          input  int                lineno = 0);

   uvm_reg_item rw;
   rw = uvm_reg_item::type_id::create("field_write_item",,get_full_name());
   //element 中存储这个 field 的指针
   rw.element      = this;
   rw.element_kind = UVM_FIELD;
   rw.kind         = UVM_WRITE;
   rw.value[0]     = value;
   rw.path         = path;
   rw.map          = map;
   rw.parent       = parent;
   rw.prior        = prior;
   rw.extension    = extension;
   rw.fname        = fname;
   rw.lineno       = lineno;

   do_write(rw);

   status = rw.status;

endtask
```

---

do_write

* 调用[Xcheck_accessX]()，对于 BACKDOOR 来说，检查是否设置了 hdl 路径; 对于 FRONTDOOR 来说，检查是否配置了 uvm_reg_map 

* 给 m_write_in_progress 赋值，标志写操作开始。检查要写入的数据是否超过了此 uvm_reg_field 所能存放的最大数值。如果超过了，给出警告，并且把超过的部分直接忽略，只考虑有效的数值。

* 取得其它 uvm_reg_field 的值，并且把它们和要写入的值一起放 入 value_adjust 中。这么做其实是为了接下来的按照整个寄存器来访问做准备的。因为并不是所有的 uvm_reg_field 都支持按照 field 访问。在不支持的情况下，那就退而 求其次，对整个寄存器进行写操作。

* 检查是否定义了宏 UVM_REG_NO_INDIVIDUAL_FIELD_ACCESS，如果定义了，那么就把 rw 的 element_kind 设置为 UVM_REG，调用 uvm_reg 的 do_write 函数，从而完全转变成了一次 uvm_reg 的 write 操作。如果没有定义，那么要调用 [is_indv_accessible]() 检查此寄存器是否允许进行按field操作。

* 在不支持按照 field 访问的情况下，把本次 write 操作变更为一次 uvm_reg 的 write 操作。

* 在支持按照 field 访问的情况下，得到最顶层的 uvm_reg_map。调用所有 [uvm_reg:Xset_busyX](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/11:%20uvm_reg/chapter%2003:%20uvm_reg.md) 把 m_is_busy 标志位设置为 1，以防止其它程序在 write 操作时执行别的操作，从而出错。

* 调用[uvm_reg_map:do_write](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/11%3A%20uvm_reg/chapter%2008%3A%20uvm_reg_map.md)

  <img width="650" alt="image" src="https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/assets/66343787/7371defd-d45c-48b5-91f9-48863577b60f">



```systemverilog
task uvm_reg_field::do_write(uvm_reg_item rw);

   uvm_reg_data_t   value_adjust;
   uvm_reg_map_info map_info;
   uvm_reg_field    fields[$];
   bit bad_side_effect;

   m_parent.XatomicX(1);
   m_fname  = rw.fname;
   m_lineno = rw.lineno;

   if (!Xcheck_accessX(rw,map_info,"write()"))
     return;

   //m_write_in_progress 赋值，标志写操作开始
   m_write_in_progress = 1'b1;

   //检查要写入的数据是否超过了此 uvm_reg_field 所能存放的最大数值。如果超过了，
   //给出警告，并且把超过的部分直接忽略，只考虑有效的数值。
   if (rw.value[0] >> m_size) begin
      `uvm_warning("RegModel", {"uvm_reg_field::write(): Value greater than field '",
                          get_full_name(),"'"})
      rw.value[0] &= ((1<<m_size)-1);
   end

   //得到此 uvm_reg_field 所在的 uvm_reg 的所有的 uvm_reg_field
   m_parent.get_fields(fields);
   foreach (fields[i]) begin

      if (fields[i] == this) begin
         value_adjust |= rw.value[0] << m_lsb;
         continue;
      end

      // 取得其它 uvm_reg_field 的值，并且把它们和要写入的值一起放 入 value_adjust 中。
      // 这么做其实是为了接下来的按照整个寄存器来访问做准备的。因为并不是所有的 uvm_reg_field
      // 都支持按照 field 访问。在不支持的情况下，那就退而求其次，对整个寄存器进行写操作。
      case (fields[i].get_access(rw.local_map))
        // These...
        "RO", "RC", "RS", "W1C", "W1S", "W1T", "W1SRC", "W1CRC":
          // Use all 0's
          value_adjust |= 0;

        // These...
        "W0C", "W0S", "W0T", "W0SRC", "W0CRS":
          // Use all 1's
          value_adjust |= ((1<<fields[i].get_n_bits())-1) << fields[i].get_lsb_pos();

        // These might have side effects! Bad!
        "WC", "WS", "WCRS", "WSRC", "WOC", "WOS":
           bad_side_effect = 1;

        default:
           value_adjust |= fields[i].m_mirrored << fields[i].get_lsb_pos();

      endcase
   end

`ifdef UVM_REG_NO_INDIVIDUAL_FIELD_ACCESS
   rw.element_kind = UVM_REG;
   rw.element = m_parent;
   rw.value[0] = value_adjust;
   m_parent.do_write(rw);   
`else        

   if (!is_indv_accessible(rw.path,rw.local_map)) begin
      //在不支持按照 field 访问的情况下，把本次 write 操作变更为一次 uvm_reg 的 write 操作
      rw.element_kind = UVM_REG;
      rw.element = m_parent;
      rw.value[0] = value_adjust;
      m_parent.do_write(rw);

      if (bad_side_effect) begin
         `uvm_warning("RegModel", $sformatf("Writing field \"%s\" will cause unintended side effects 
         in adjoining Write-to-Clear or Write-to-Set fields in the same register", this.get_full_name()));
      end
   end
   else begin

     uvm_reg_map system_map = rw.local_map.get_root_map();
     uvm_reg_field_cb_iter cbs = new(this);

     //以防止其它程序在 write 操作时执行别的操作，从而出错。这里与 XatomicX 相似，都是为了保证对互斥资源的访问
     m_parent.Xset_busyX(1);

     rw.status = UVM_IS_OK;

     pre_write(rw);
     for (uvm_reg_cbs cb=cbs.first(); cb!=null; cb=cbs.next())
        cb.pre_write(rw);

     if (rw.status != UVM_IS_OK) begin
        m_write_in_progress = 1'b0;
        m_parent.Xset_busyX(0);
        m_parent.XatomicX(0);

        return;
     end

     //read the actual data from rtl
     rw.local_map.do_write(rw);

     if (system_map.get_auto_predict())
        // ToDo: Call parent.XsampleX();
        do_predict(rw, UVM_PREDICT_WRITE);

     post_write(rw);
     for (uvm_reg_cbs cb=cbs.first(); cb!=null; cb=cbs.next())
        cb.post_write(rw);

     m_parent.Xset_busyX(0);

   end

`endif

   m_write_in_progress = 1'b0;
   m_parent.XatomicX(0);

endtask: do_write

```

