```  

* has_coverage 是一个 [uvm_coverage_model_e]() 类型的变量

  <img width="750" alt="image" src="https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/assets/66343787/209b9d1d-9323-4126-8a92-5fcdaaac4a8e">

