add_field

* 被 [uvm_reg_field:configure](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/11%3A%20uvm_reg/chapter%2001%3A%20uvm_reg_field.md) 调用，把 uvm_reg_field 添加到 uvm_reg 中

```systemverilog
protected uvm_reg_field m_fields[$];   // Fields in LSB to MSB order
```

* 当整个的register model建立完成后，会在最顶层的uvm_reg_block调用 lock 相关函数，把整个模型锁起来。

* 调用 [uvm_reg_field:get_lsb_pos]() 返回此 uvm_reg_field 的最低位在 uvm_reg 中的位置。按照 offset 的值将其添加到 m_fields 中，并记录总位宽 m_n_used_bits，如果大于设定则报错。**m_fields 中的记录是按照 lsb 从小到大的顺序排列的** 

* 检查添加到 field 之间是否有重叠覆盖到位置，如果有则报错。

```systemverilog
function void uvm_reg::add_field(uvm_reg_field field);
   int offset;
   int idx;

   //check if the register is already locked
   if (m_locked) begin
      `uvm_error("RegModel", "Cannot add field to locked register model");
      return;
   end

   //check the availability of the field
   if (field == null) `uvm_fatal("RegModel", "Attempting to register NULL field");

   // Store fields in LSB to MSB order
   offset = field.get_lsb_pos();

   //insert current reg_field into this register
   //idx is the index of the current reg_field index after inserted into the register
   idx = -1;
   foreach (m_fields[i]) begin
      if (offset < m_fields[i].get_lsb_pos()) begin
         int j = i;
         m_fields.insert(j, field);
         idx = i;
         break;
      end
   end

   //insert to the end of the register
   if (idx < 0) begin
      m_fields.push_back(field);
      idx = m_fields.size()-1;
   end

   //get the total number of bits fo this register
   m_n_used_bits += field.get_n_bits();

   // Check if there are too many fields in the register
   if (m_n_used_bits > m_n_bits) begin
      `uvm_error("RegModel",
         $sformatf("Fields use more bits (%0d) than available in register \"%s\" (%0d)",
            m_n_used_bits, get_name(), m_n_bits));
   end

   // Check if there are overlapping fields
   // check if the current field is overlapped with the previous field
   if (idx > 0) begin
      if (m_fields[idx-1].get_lsb_pos() +
          m_fields[idx-1].get_n_bits() > offset) begin
         `uvm_error("RegModel", $sformatf("Field %s overlaps field %s in register \"%s\"",
                                        m_fields[idx-1].get_name(),
                                        field.get_name(), get_name()));
      end
   end
   // check if the current field is overlapped with the next field
   if (idx < m_fields.size()-1) begin
      if (offset + field.get_n_bits() >
          m_fields[idx+1].get_lsb_pos()) begin
         `uvm_error("RegModel", $sformatf("Field %s overlaps field %s in register \"%s\"",
                                        field.get_name(),
                                        m_fields[idx+1].get_name(),
                                      get_name()));
      end
   end
endfunction: add_field
```
