* 被[uvm_reg_block:lock_model](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/11%3A%20uvm_reg/chapter%2005%3A%20uvm_reg_block.md)调用
