Xcheck_accessX

* 被 [do_write/do_read]() 调用，对于 BACKDOOR 来说，检查是否设置了 hdl 路径; 对于 FRONTDOOR 来说，检查是否配置了 uvm_reg_map 

* 如果在调用 write 时没有指定操作方式，调用 [uvm_reg_block:get_default_path](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/edit/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/11%3A%20uvm_reg/chapter%2005%3A%20uvm_reg_block.md) 递归向上寻找获取访问方式。不指定操作方式，那么将会使用 FRONTDOOR 方式。

* **前门访问:当使用 FRONTDOOR 方式时，这个函数主要是检查要读写的寄存器的 uvm_reg_map 是否准备好了，其地址如果没有被初始化过，那么看一下是否定义了自己的 frontdoor。**

   * 调用 [get_local_map]() 获取当前操作对应的map，在没有找到 local map 的情况下，把 rw 的 status 置为 UVM_NOT_OK，直接返回 0。

   * 调用 [uvm_reg_map:get_reg_map_info](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/11%3A%20uvm_reg/chapter%2008%3A%20uvm_reg_map.md) 检查寄存器中的地址信息是全局地址信息。获取到一个 [uvm_reg_map_info](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/11%3A%20uvm_reg/chapter%2008%3A%20uvm_reg_map.md) 类型的对象

   * 判断返回的此寄存器的 uvm_reg_map_info 信息中 frontdoor 是否为 null，且 unmapped 是否为 1，如果 unmapped 被设置为 1，那么此寄存器的地址信息就没有被 [uvm_reg_map:Xinit_addresss_mapX](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/11%3A%20uvm_reg/chapter%2008%3A%20uvm_reg_map.md) 初始化。没有初始化过，那么就不能使用系统定义的 FRONTDOOR 操作。

* **后门访问: 检查是否设置了 hdl 路径**

```systemverilog
function bit uvm_reg::Xcheck_accessX (input uvm_reg_item rw,
                                      output uvm_reg_map_info map_info,
                                      input string caller);

   // If no path specified, get default path from parent block
   if (rw.path == UVM_DEFAULT_PATH)
     rw.path = m_parent.get_default_path();

   // Handle backdoor access
   if (rw.path == UVM_BACKDOOR) begin
      // Check if backdoor access is available
      if (get_backdoor() == null && !has_hdl_path()) begin
         `uvm_warning("RegModel",
            {"No backdoor access available for register '",get_full_name(),
            "' . Using frontdoor instead."})
         rw.path = UVM_FRONTDOOR;
      end
      else
        rw.map = uvm_reg_map::backdoor();
   end

   // Handle frontdoor access
   if (rw.path != UVM_BACKDOOR) begin

     // Get local map for this register
     // 通常情况下传入的 rw.map 为 null，所以这里调用 get_local_map 获取到当前寄存器的 local map
     rw.local_map = get_local_map(rw.map,caller);

     // Error if no local map found
     if (rw.local_map == null) begin
        `uvm_error(get_type_name(), 
           {"No transactor available to physically access register on map '",
            rw.map.get_full_name(),"'"})
        rw.status = UVM_NOT_OK;
        return 0;
     end

     // Get map info for this register
     map_info = rw.local_map.get_reg_map_info(this);

     // Error if register is unmapped and has no frontdoor
     if (map_info.frontdoor == null && map_info.unmapped) begin
          `uvm_error("RegModel", {"Register '",get_full_name(),
             "' unmapped in map '",
             (rw.map==null)? rw.local_map.get_full_name():rw.map.get_full_name(),
             "' and does not have a user-defined frontdoor"})
          rw.status = UVM_NOT_OK;
          return 0;
     end

     // Set map to local map if not specified
     if (rw.map == null)
       rw.map = rw.local_map;
   end
   return 1;
endfunction
```
