get_backdoor

* 被 [do_write]() 调用
* 获取自定义的backdoor操作，如果定义了就直接返回，否则整个函数就调用 [uvm_reg_block:get_backdoor](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/11%3A%20uvm_reg/chapter%2005%3A%20uvm_reg_block.md) 递归的向上查找是否哪个 uvm_reg_block 定义了 [backdoor](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/11%3A%20uvm_reg/chapter%2012%3A%20uvm_reg_backdoor.md)，如果定义了那么就直接返回，否则返回 null。

```systemverilog
function uvm_reg_backdoor uvm_reg::get_backdoor(bit inherited = 1);

   if (m_backdoor == null && inherited) begin
     uvm_reg_block blk = get_parent();
     uvm_reg_backdoor bkdr;
     while (blk != null) begin
       bkdr = blk.get_backdoor();
       if (bkdr != null) begin
         m_backdoor = bkdr;
         break;
       end
       blk = blk.get_parent();
     end
   end
   return m_backdoor;
endfunction: get_backdoor
```

