backdoor_write

* 被 [do_write/poke]() 调用，通过后门访问的方式将数值写入到 rtl 中
* 调用 [get_full_hdl_path]() 获取到绝对路径
* 调用 [uvm_hdl_inca:uvm_hdl_deposit](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/09:%20uvm_dpi/chapter%2005:%20uvm_hdl_inca.md) 写入每一个 field 的对应数值

```systemverilog
task  uvm_reg::backdoor_write(uvm_reg_item rw);
  uvm_hdl_path_concat paths[$];
  bit ok=1;

  // Get the full HDL path for the register
  get_full_hdl_path(paths,rw.bd_kind);

  foreach (paths[i]) begin
     uvm_hdl_path_concat hdl_concat = paths[i];
     foreach (hdl_concat.slices[j]) begin
        `uvm_info("RegMem", {"backdoor_write to ",
                  hdl_concat.slices[j].path},UVM_DEBUG)

        // If offset is negative, write the entire value
        if (hdl_concat.slices[j].offset < 0) begin
           ok &= uvm_hdl_deposit(hdl_concat.slices[j].path,rw.value[0]);
           continue;
        end
        begin
           uvm_reg_data_t slice;
           // Extract the relevant bits from the value
           slice = rw.value[0] >> hdl_concat.slices[j].offset;
           // Mask off any extra bits
           slice &= (1 << hdl_concat.slices[j].size)-1;
           // Write the slice to the HDL path
           ok &= uvm_hdl_deposit(hdl_concat.slices[j].path, slice);
        end
     end
  end

  // Set the status based on whether all writes were successful
  rw.status = (ok ? UVM_IS_OK : UVM_NOT_OK);
endtask
```

