peek

* **peek 操作对应 BACKDOOR 方式的 read 操作，区别就是不会模仿 FRONTDOOR。不会考虑寄存器中的当前值以及寄存器的读清特性，函数读出什么数值就是什么**
* 整个函数与 poke 函数几乎也是对偶的，唯一的区别就是调用 [backdoor_read]() 函数。

```systemverilog
task uvm_reg::peek(output uvm_status_e      status,
                   output uvm_reg_data_t    value,
                   input  string            kind = "",
                   input  uvm_sequence_base parent = null,
                   input  uvm_object        extension = null,
                   input  string            fname = "",
                   input  int               lineno = 0);

   uvm_reg_backdoor bkdr = get_backdoor();
   uvm_reg_item rw;

   m_fname = fname;
   m_lineno = lineno;

   if (bkdr == null && !has_hdl_path(kind)) begin
      `uvm_error("RegModel",
        $sformatf("No backdoor access available to peek register \"%s\"",
                  get_full_name()));
      status = UVM_NOT_OK;
      return;
   end

   if(!m_is_locked_by_field)
      XatomicX(1);

   // create an abstract transaction for this operation
   rw = uvm_reg_item::type_id::create("mem_peek_item",,get_full_name());
   rw.element      = this;
   rw.path         = UVM_BACKDOOR;
   rw.element_kind = UVM_REG;
   rw.kind         = UVM_READ;
   rw.bd_kind      = kind;
   rw.parent       = parent;
   rw.extension    = extension;
   rw.fname        = fname;
   rw.lineno       = lineno;

   if (bkdr != null)
     bkdr.read(rw);
   else
     backdoor_read(rw);

   status = rw.status;
   value = rw.value[0];

   `uvm_info("RegModel", $sformatf("Peeked register \"%s\": 'h%h",
                          get_full_name(), value),UVM_HIGH);

   do_predict(rw, UVM_PREDICT_READ);

   if (!m_is_locked_by_field)
      XatomicX(0);
endtask: peek

```
---

update

* 向DUT写入一个寄存器值。update 方法属于 uvm_reg 类。 uvm_reg_field 类没有 update 方法，但是 uvm_reg_block 有 update 方法
* write方法和update方法之间的区别是：

  * write方法将一个值作为其参数，而update方法使用m_desired属性的值作为要写入的值
  * 只有当m_mirrored和m_desired不相等时，update方法才写入该值

    <img width="600" alt="image" src="https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/66343787/182062657-65a22dbe-dcb3-4364-9b6b-d7cc3b88b1c9.png">

    <img width="600" alt="image" src="https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/66343787/182062688-29b70af5-9396-4d15-84f1-e4364572b9d9.png">

* 调用 [needs_update]()，检查m_mirrored 的值与 m_desired 的值是否一样，不一致的话返回 1，表明需要进行更新
* 调用 [write]() 方法将新的值写入到 rtl 并更新 register model

```systemverilog
task uvm_reg::update(output uvm_status_e      status,
                     input  uvm_path_e        path = UVM_DEFAULT_PATH,
                     input  uvm_reg_map       map = null,
                     input  uvm_sequence_base parent = null,
                     input  int               prior = -1,
                     input  uvm_object        extension = null,
                     input  string            fname = "",
                     input  int               lineno = 0);
   uvm_reg_data_t upd;

   status = UVM_IS_OK;

   // if desired value is same as mirrored value for all fields, then no need to update
   if (!needs_update()) return;

   // Concatenate the write-to-update values from each field based on the access 
   upd = 0;
   foreach (m_fields[i])
      upd |= m_fields[i].XupdateX() << m_fields[i].get_lsb_pos();

   write(status, upd, path, map, parent, prior, extension, fname, lineno);
endtask: update
```

