get_mirrored_value

* 被 [mirror]() 调用，返回当前 register model 中的 mirror 值
* 调用每一个 [uvm_reg_field:get_mirrored_value](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/11%3A%20uvm_reg/chapter%2001%3A%20uvm_reg_field.md)，将返回值组合成最终的数值

```systemverilog
function uvm_reg_data_t  uvm_reg::get_mirrored_value(string  fname = "",
                                      int     lineno = 0);
   // Concatenate the value of the individual fields
   // to form the register value
   m_fname = fname;
   m_lineno = lineno;

   get_mirrored_value = 0;

   foreach (m_fields[i])
      get_mirrored_value |= m_fields[i].get_mirrored_value() << m_fields[i].get_lsb_pos();
endfunction: get_mirrored_value
```

