predict

* 更新镜像值。也会更新 value 和m_desired属性

  <img width="550" alt="image" src="https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/66343787/182062746-371892c4-60e8-42ec-b173-6c8f66794a1c.png">

* 调用 [do_predict]()

```systemverilog
function bit uvm_reg::predict (uvm_reg_data_t    value,
                               uvm_reg_byte_en_t be = -1,
                               uvm_predict_e     kind = UVM_PREDICT_DIRECT,
                               uvm_path_e        path = UVM_FRONTDOOR,
                               uvm_reg_map       map = null,
                               string            fname = "",
                               int               lineno = 0);
  uvm_reg_item rw = new;
  rw.value[0] = value;
  rw.path = path;
  rw.map = map;
  rw.fname = fname;
  rw.lineno = lineno;
  do_predict(rw, kind, be);
  predict = (rw.status == UVM_NOT_OK) ? 0 : 1;
endfunction: predict
```

