set_frontdoor

* 可以手动调用这个函数，将自定义 sequence 传入，在前面访问的时候会调用自定义的 sequence

```systemverilog
function void uvm_reg::set_frontdoor(uvm_reg_frontdoor ftdr,
                                     uvm_reg_map       map = null,
                                     string            fname = "",
                                     int               lineno = 0);
   uvm_reg_map_info map_info;

   // Set file name and line number for the frontdoor
   ftdr.fname = m_fname;
   ftdr.lineno = m_lineno;

   // Get the local map for this register
   map = get_local_map(map, "set_frontdoor()");
   if (map == null)
     return;

   // Get the map info for this register
   map_info = map.get_reg_map_info(this);

   // If map info doesn't exist, add the register to the map with the frontdoor
   if (map_info == null)
      map.add_reg(this, -1, "RW", 1, ftdr);
   else begin
      // If map info exists, update the frontdoor
      map_info.frontdoor = ftdr;
   end
endfunction: set_frontdoor
```

