---

lock_model

* 在使用UVM寄存器模型的时候，当整个模型建立完成以后，必须在root block中调用lock_model，这样整个模型才算建立完整，因为在建立模型的时候所有寄存器的地址均是相对地址，在进行前门访问，是以绝对地址进行的，因此lock_model帮助我们得到所有寄存器的绝对地址。模型一旦建立，不允许除了与硬件之间的交互之外的其他访问。

* 检查此 uvm_reg_block 是否已经 lock 了。如果已经被 lock 了，也即 lock_model 已经被调用过一次了，那么这里将会直接返回。
* 把 locked 赋值，表明 lock_model 已经被调用过了。
* 调用所有加入到此 uvm_reg_block 的 [uvm_reg:Xlock_modelX](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/11%3A%20uvm_reg/chapter%2003%3A%20uvm_reg.md) / [uvm_mem:Xlock_modelX](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/11%3A%20uvm_reg/chapter%2007%3A%20uvm_mem.md) / [uvm_reg_block:lock_model](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/11%3A%20uvm_reg/chapter%2005%3A%20uvm_reg_block.md) m_locked = 1。

* 获取 uvm_reg / uvm_reg_field / uvm_mem 的最大宽度，判断是否超出了 [uvm_reg_defines:UVM_REG_DATA_WIDTH](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/02%3A%20uvm_macros/chapter%2006%3A%20uvm_reg_defines.md) 的限制。可以通过重定义这个宏给扩展 register model 所能容忍的最大位宽。默认情况下，此值为 64。

* 调用 [Xinit_address_mapsX]()

* 判断 m_roots 中最顶层的 uvm_reg_block 是否重名。如果 m_roots 中有 blk 的 get_name 的返回值等于此 name，那么有两种情况，一种是此 uvm_reg_block 就是这个最顶层的 uvm_reg_block，另外一种情况是有其它的 uvm_reg_block 和最顶层的 uvm_reg_block 重名了。
```systemverilog
function void uvm_reg_block::lock_model();

   if (is_locked())
     return;

   locked = 1;

   foreach (regs[rg_]) begin
      uvm_reg rg = rg_;
      rg.Xlock_modelX();
   end

   foreach (mems[mem_]) begin
      uvm_mem mem = mem_;
      mem.Xlock_modelX();
   end

   foreach (blks[blk_]) begin
      uvm_reg_block blk=blk_;
      blk.lock_model();
   end

   //check if this is top reg_block
   if (this.parent == null) begin
      int max_size = uvm_reg::get_max_size();

      if (uvm_reg_field::get_max_size() > max_size)
         max_size = uvm_reg_field::get_max_size();

      if (uvm_mem::get_max_size() > max_size)
         max_size = uvm_mem::get_max_size();

      if (max_size > `UVM_REG_DATA_WIDTH) begin
         `uvm_fatal("RegModel", $sformatf("Register model requires that UVM_REG_DATA_WIDTH be 
         defined as %0d or greater. Currently defined as %0d", max_size, `UVM_REG_DATA_WIDTH))
      end

      Xinit_address_mapsX();

      // Check that root register models have unique names

      // Has this name has been checked before?
      if (m_roots[this] != 1) begin
         int n;

         foreach (m_roots[_blk]) begin
            uvm_reg_block blk = _blk;

            if (blk.get_name() == get_name()) begin
               m_roots[blk] = 1;
               n++;
            end
         end

         if (n > 1) begin
            `uvm_error("UVM/REG/DUPLROOT",
                       $sformatf("There are %0d root register models named \"%s\". The names of 
                       the root register models have to be unique",
                                 n, get_name()))
         end
      end
   end

endfunction: lock_model
```
