add_reg

* 调用这个函数将 reg 添加到 reg_map 中 -- 把 map 的信息写入到了待加入的 uvm_reg 的 m_maps 数组中，把此 reg 的信息加入到了此 map 的 m_regs_info 数组中，这个函数需要手动调用，通常在 uvm_reg_block 的 build 函数中创建 map 并添加 reg 

```systemverilog
this.default_map.add_reg(.rg(this.VVILD_REG), .offset(`UVM_REG_ADDR_WIDTH'H699C), .rights("RW"), .unmapped(0));
```
* 检查此 reg 是否已经加入到此 uvm_reg_map 中了，**检查要加入的 uvm_reg 与此 map 的 parent block 是否是同一个 uvm_reg_block。只有属于同一个 uvm_reg_block，才能加入。**

  * uvm_reg_map: 在 [uvm_reg_map:configure]() 中更新 parent
  * uvm_reg: 在 [uvm_reg:configure](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/11%3A%20uvm_reg/chapter%2003%3A%20uvm_reg.md) 中更新 parent

* 调用[uvm_reg:add_map](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/11%3A%20uvm_reg/chapter%2003%3A%20uvm_reg.md)

* [uvm_reg_map_info]() 的变量，并把其加入到 m_regs_info 联合数组中。因此，m_regs_info 联合数组的索引就是所有加入到此 uvm_reg_block 的 uvm_reg 实例的指针，而内容则是对应此 uvm_reg 实例的信息，如地址，存取策略等信息。注意的是，这里的地址只是一个相对地址，即相对此 uvm_reg_map 的基地址的偏移地址。

```systemverilog
local uvm_reg_map_info   m_regs_info[uvm_reg];
```

```systemverilog
function void uvm_reg_map::add_reg(uvm_reg rg, 
                                   uvm_reg_addr_t offset,
                                   string rights = "RW",
                                   bit unmapped=0,
                                   uvm_reg_frontdoor frontdoor=null);

   // Check if register already exists in the map
   if (m_regs_info.exists(rg)) begin
      `uvm_error("RegModel", {"Register '",rg.get_name(),
                 "' has already been added to map '",get_name(),"'"})
      return;
   end

   // Ensure register and map belong to the same parent block
   if (rg.get_parent() != get_parent()) begin
      `uvm_error("RegModel",
         {"Register '",rg.get_full_name(),"' may not be added to address map '",
          get_full_name(),"' : they are not in the same block"})
      return;
   end

   // Add this map to the register's list of maps
   rg.add_map(this);

   // Create and populate register map info
   begin
      uvm_reg_map_info info = new;
      info.offset    = offset;
      info.rights    = rights;
      info.unmapped  = unmapped;
      info.frontdoor = frontdoor;
      m_regs_info[rg] = info;
   end
endfunction

