    |     Word 0      |     Word 1     |     Word 2     |     Word 3     |
    | 0             15 16            31 32            47 48            63|
    +-----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+
                      |<--3-->|<--13-->|<----5--->|
                      |  extra|  field |  field   |
                              19      32         37       
                              |<---18 bits------->|
                      |<--21 bits (n_access)----->|

    Legend:
    |<--3-->| : n_access_extra (3 bits)
    |<--13-->|<----5--->| : Field width (18 bits)
    |<--------21 bits (n_access)----------->| : Total access width

    Physical addresses:
    [0-15]   : Word 0 (not used for this field)
