10.transaction类型的匹配

* 需要在声明 sequence 和 sequencer 中指定 sequence_item 的类型
* sequence
  * 在 [uvm_sequence:get_response](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2007%3A%20uvm_sequence.md) 中，需要声明 sequenc_item 的具体类型，通过这个类型获取到 response
  * 这里没有类型转换，所有的过程中都是使用自定义的 sequence_item 类型

    ```systemverilog
    class case0_sequence extends uvm_sequence #(my_transaction);
    ```

* sequencer
  * 在 [uvm_sequencer_param_base:send_request](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/05%3A%20uvm_seq/chapter%2006%3A%20uvm_sequencer_param_base.md#send_request) 中，传入的是一个 sequence_item 类型的变量，在发送之前需要进行类型的转换，转换成在声明的时候使用的 SEQ 类型，转换之后才可以发送。

    ```systemverilog
    class case0_sequencer extends uvm_sequencer #(my_transaction);
    ```

  * 在 driver 中接收的时候，要按照需求进行转型，如果发送来的是 sequence_item 类型的，但是想要使用的是子类型，则需要向下 cast，否则无法找到并使用子类型中的变量

    ```systemverilog
    task my_driver::main_phase(uvm_phase phase);
       my_transaction m_tr;
       your_transaction y_tr;
       vif.data <= 8'b0;
       vif.valid <= 1'b0;
       while(!vif.rst_n)
          @(posedge vif.clk);
       while(1) begin
          seq_item_port.get_next_item(req); //这里拿到的是 sequencer 中声明的类型
          if($cast(m_tr, req)) begin
              drive_my_transaction(m_tr);
             `uvm_info("driver", "receive a transaction whose type is my_transaction", UVM_MEDIUM)
          end
          else if($cast(y_tr, req)) begin
             drive_your_transaction(y_tr);
             `uvm_info("driver", "receive a transaction whose type is your_transaction", UVM_MEDIUM)
          end
          else begin
             `uvm_error("driver", "receive a transaction whose type is unknown")
          end
          seq_item_port.item_done();
       end
    endtask
    ```

* driver
  * 在 [uvm_driver](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/04:%20uvm_comps/chapter%2002:%20uvm_driver.md) 中需要声明 sequence_item 的类型，这样可以通过 TLM 直接从 sequencer 中获取到

    ```systemverilog
    class uvm_driver #(type REQ=uvm_sequence_item, type RSP=REQ) extends uvm_component;
    ```

* rsp与req类型不同
  * 如果要使用不同类型的rsp与req，那么 driver、sequencer与sequence在定义时都要传入两个参数

    ```systemverilog
    class my_driver extends uvm_driver#(my_transaction, your_transaction);
    class my_sequencer extends uvm_sequencer #(my_transaction, your_transaction);
    class case0_sequence extends uvm_sequence #(my_transaction, your_transaction);
    ```

