9.functions

* can_* functions (e.g., can_put(), can_get(), can_peek()):
  * These are used to check if an operation is possible without actually performing the operation.
  * They typically return a boolean value (1 if the operation is possible, 0 if not).
  * They don't change the state of the port or the underlying data.
  * They are often used to avoid blocking or to make decisions based on the current state of the port.

* try_* functions (e.g., try_put(), try_get(), try_peek()):
  * These attempt to perform the operation immediately (non-blocking).
  * They return a success/failure status (usually 1 for success, 0 for failure).
  * If successful, they actually perform the operation (e.g., put an item, get an item).
  * They may change the state of the port or the underlying data if successful.

* examples

```systemverilog
class my_tlm_component #(type T1=int, type T2=int) extends uvm_component implements uvm_tlm_if_base#(T1, T2);

  T1 queue[$];
  int max_size = 10; // Example max size for the queue

  function new(string name, uvm_component parent);
    super.new(name, parent);
  endfunction

  // Blocking put
  virtual task put(input T1 t);
    while (queue.size() >= max_size) #1;
    queue.push_back(t);
  endtask

  // Blocking get
  virtual task get(output T2 t);
    while (queue.size() == 0) #1;
    t = T2'(queue.pop_front());
  endtask

  // Blocking peek
  virtual task peek(output T2 t);
    while (queue.size() == 0) #1;
    t = T2'(queue[0]);
  endtask

  // Non-blocking put
  virtual function bit try_put(input T1 t);
    if (queue.size() < max_size) begin
      queue.push_back(t);
      return 1;
    end
    return 0;
  endfunction

  // Check if put is possible
  virtual function bit can_put();
    return (queue.size() < max_size);
  endfunction

  // Non-blocking get
  virtual function bit try_get(output T2 t);
    if (queue.size() > 0) begin
      t = T2'(queue.pop_front());
      return 1;
    end
    return 0;
  endfunction

  // Check if get is possible
  virtual function bit can_get();
    return (queue.size() > 0);
  endfunction

  // Non-blocking peek
  virtual function bit try_peek(output T2 t);
    if (queue.size() > 0) begin
      t = T2'(queue[0]);
      return 1;
    end
    return 0;
  endfunction

  // Check if peek is possible
  virtual function bit can_peek();
    return (queue.size() > 0);
  endfunction

  // Blocking transport
  virtual task transport(input T1 req, output T2 rsp);
    put(req);
    get(rsp);
  endtask

  // Non-blocking transport
  virtual function bit nb_transport(input T1 req, output T2 rsp);
    if (try_put(req) && try_get(rsp))
      return 1;
    return 0;
  endfunction

  // Write (for analysis ports)
  virtual function void write(input T1 t);
    void'(try_put(t));
  endfunction

endclass
```

register build flow

![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6d0a8ccf-a111-4127-b1c4-fbce77b00411)

* **configure**是对当前block自己的信息进行配置和初始化，并将当前的模块本身加入到父类的记录中，**build**是自定义方法，通常里面包括对当前block中包含的其他 register 模块进行创建和 configure，因此当前 block 的 configure 会在上一个层级调用，而当前层级又会通过 build 方法调用子 block 的 configure 方法，以此类推，直到最底层的 block 调用完成。

  ```systemverilog
  class ral_reg_VVILD_REGISTER_BLOCK_default extends uvm_reg_block;

      rand ral_reg_VVILD_REG VVILD_REG;
      rand uvm_reg_field VVILD_REGISTER_FIELD0;
      rand uvm_reg_field VVILD_REGISTER_FIELD1;

      function new(string name = "VVILD_REGISTER_BLOCK_default");
          super.new(name, build_coverage(UVM_NO_COVERAGE));
      endfunction : new

      virtual function void build();
          this.default_map = create_map(
              .name(""),
              .base_addr(0),
              .n_bytes(4),
              .endian(UVM_LITTLE_ENDIAN)
          );

          this.VVILD_REG = ral_reg_VVILD_REG::type_id::create("VVILD_REG",, get_full_name());
          //configuration itself
          this.VVILD_REG.configure(.blk_parent(this), .regfile_parent(null), .hdl_path(""));
          //create and configure the sub object
          this.VVILD_REG.build();
          this.default_map.add_reg(.rg(this.VVILD_REG), .offset(`UVM_REG_ADDR_WIDTH'H699C), .rights("RW"), .unmapped(0));
          this.VVILD_REGISTER_FIELD0 = this.VVILD_REG.VVILD_REGISTER_FIELD0;
          this.VVILD_REGISTER_FIELD1 = this.VVILD_REG.VVILD_REGISTER_FIELD1;
      endfunction

      `uvm_object_utils(ral_reg_VVILD_REGISTER_BLOCK_default)

  endclass
  ```


* [uvm_reg_field:configure]() -> [uvm_reg:add_field]()

  * uvm_reg_field:configure: 在 uvm_reg 的 build 方法中先创建 field，再调用这个方法将 field 加入到 uvm_reg 中
  * uvm_reg:add_field: 将 reg_field 添加到 m_fields 中，并通过 m_parent 保存 uvm_reg 信息

* [uvm_reg:configure]() -> [uvm_reg_block:add_field]()

  * uvm_reg:configure: 将 uvm_reg 添加到 uvm_reg_block 的时候调用

    * 在 uvm_reg_block 的 regs 数组中插入了一条记录，记录的索引是这个uvm_reg的指针，记录的内容是register model中已经加入到uvm_reg_block 的 uvm_reg 的数量
    * 在 hdl_path 不为 null 的情况下，向 m_hdl_paths_pool 中索引为”RTL”的记录对应的队列中的最后一条记录的 uvm_hdl_path_concat 的实例的动态数组中插入一条记录

* [uvm_reg_block:create_map]() -> [uvm_reg_map:configure]() -> [uvm_reg_map:add_reg/add_mem]() -> [uvm_reg_map:add_submap]()

  * create_map: 通常情况下在 uvm_reg_block 的 build 方法中调用，创建一个 map 并将其设置为 default_map
  * configure: 调用 uvm_reg_map 的 configure 方法，设置 map 的 offset, rights, unmapped, frontdoor 等属性
  * add_reg: 将当前 uvm_reg_block 中的所有 uvm_reg_block 中的所有 uvm_reg/uvm_mem 添加到 map 中，map 会主动添加 reg 和 mem
  * add_submap: 如果存在 subblock，则将 submap 添加到 map 中

