3 examples

> parameterized class must have a defulat value for all parameters, otherwise there is syntax error

* Parameterized Parent Class, Non-Parameterized Child Class
* In this case, child_class is a specific instantiation of parent_class with PARAM set to 20.

  ```systemverilog
  class parent_class #(int PARAM = 10) extends uvm_component;
    // ... class implementation ...
  endclass

  class child_class extends parent_class#(20);
    // ... class implementation ...
  endclass

  // Override
  factory.set_type_override_by_type(parent_class#(20)::get_type(), child_class::get_type());
  ```

* Parameterized Parent Class, Child Class with New Parameters:
* child_class has its own parameter PARAM2, which is also used to set PARAM1 of the parent class.

  ```systemverilog
  class parent_class #(int PARAM1 = 10) extends uvm_component;
    `uvm_component_param_utils(parent_class#(PARAM1))
  endclass

  class child_class #(int PARAM2 = 5) extends parent_class#(PARAM2);
    `uvm_component_param_utils(child_class#(PARAM2))
  endclass

  // Override
  factory.set_type_override_by_type(parent_class#(5)::get_type(), child_class#(5)::get_type());

  ```

* Parameterized Parent Class, Child Class with Both Parent and New Parameters:
* In this case, child_class can override the parent's parameters and add its own.

  ```systemverilog
  class parent_class #(int PARAM1 = 10, string PARAM2 = "hello") extends uvm_component;
    `uvm_component_param_utils(parent_class#(PARAM1, PARAM2))
  endclass

  class child_class #(int PARAM1 = 20, string PARAM2 = "world", int PARAM3 = 30) 
    extends parent_class#(PARAM1, PARAM2);
    `uvm_component_param_utils(child_class#(PARAM1, PARAM2, PARAM3))
  endclass

  // Override
  factory.set_type_override_by_type(parent_class#(20, "world")::get_type(), 
                                    child_class#(20, "world", 30)::get_type());
  ``` 


* Now, let's consider how these different scenarios affect factory registration and overriding:

* Correct Registration (using uvm_component_param_utils):

  ```systemverilog
  class my_param_class #(int PARAM = 5) extends uvm_component;
    `uvm_component_param_utils(my_param_class#(PARAM))
  endclass

  class my_derived_class #(int PARAM = 10) extends my_param_class#(PARAM);
    `uvm_component_param_utils(my_derived_class#(PARAM))
  endclass

  // Override
  factory.set_type_override_by_type(my_param_class#(5)::get_type(), 
                                    my_derived_class#(5)::get_type());
  ```

uvm_printer

* field_automation其中一个功能是可以自动地打印激励数据,在使用uvm_field_xxx方法注册参数时，使能打印开关即可。
* 注册参数的自动化打印借助uvm_printer实现，从前面的例子可以看到默认的uvm_printer使用的是uvm_table_printer,按照表格形式打印数据。除此之外还有uvm_tree_printer的树形打印和uvm_line_printer的单行打印。
* uvm_printer机制不仅可以实现注册参数的格式化打印，而且开放回调的函数接口，允许我们自定义这些参数的打印格式。

```systemverilog
import uvm_pkg::*;
`include "uvm_macros.svh"
class c1 extends uvm_sequence_item;
    typedef enum {RED=0,BLUE=1,GREEN=2} color;
    rand color    theme;uvm_hybrid_printer
    rand bit[3:0] addr;
    `uvm_object_utils_begin(c1)
        `uvm_field_int(addr,UVM_PRINT)
        `uvm_field_enum(color,theme,UVM_PRINT)
    `uvm_object_utils_end
    function new(string name="c1");
        super.new(name);
    endfunction
endclass
program tb_top;
    initial begin
        c1 obj = new();
        obj.randomize();
        obj.print();
    end
endprogram
//print result:
------------------------------
 Name     Type      Size  Value
------------------------------
 c1       c1        -     @466 
   addr   integral  4     'he  
   theme  color     32    BLUE 
------------------------------
```
