wait_modified

* uvm_config_db的wait_modified可以用于两个组件之间的同步，比如sequence和scoreboard，testbench和test等。一般和set、get函数配合使用，在A组件set，B组件wait_modified后，使用get获取参数修改后的值。

  <img width="650" alt="image" src="https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/assets/66343787/b6ebf926-5d2d-45f4-b3fd-a81e08f33e25">

* demo


  ```systemverilog
  class my_test extends uvm_test;
    int set_value;
    int get_value;

    task config_db_set();
      fork while(1) begin
        set_value++;
        uvm_config_db #(int)::set(this,"","sync",set_value);
        `uvm_info("",$sformatf("<=== set_value=%0d",set_value),UVM_LOW)
        #1;
      end join_none
    endtask

    task config_db_get();
      fork while(1) begin
        uvm_config_db #(int)::wait_modified(this,"","sync");
        uvm_config_db #(int)::get(this,"","sync",get_value);
        `uvm_info("",$sformatf("---> get_value=%0d",get_value),UVM_LOW)
      end join_none
    endtask

    task run_phase(uvm_phase phase);
      phase.raise_objection(this);
      config_db_set();
      config_db_get();
      wait(set_value==4);
      phase.drop_objection(this);  
    endtask
  ```

* **第一次set的数据并没有被get到**

  <img width="650" alt="image" src="https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/assets/66343787/1c343ed5-eb77-4bf2-b150-b905bcfb90e1">

