UVM 正则表达式

* UVM给我们提供了两个接口，分别是如下两个函数:

```systemverilog
function int uvm_re_match(string re, string str);
function string uvm_glob_to_re(string glob);
```

* [uvm_glob_to_re](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/09%3A%20uvm_dpi/chapter%2001%3A%20uvm_regex.md)函数输入一个你想匹配的字符串，然后返回给你正则表达式.
* [uvm_re_match](https://github.com/jiru1997/VLSI-Design-verification-interview/blob/main/VLSI%20Design%20Verification/Functional%20Verification/UVM1.2%20source%20code%20analysis/09%3A%20uvm_dpi/chapter%2001%3A%20uvm_regex.md)函数则是输入你想匹配的正则表达式字符串re，以及你想匹配的目标字符串str，如果匹配到了，则返回0，否则返回1

```systemverilog
begin
    int temp_int = 'd123;
    string temp_str = "default_str";
    string glob_str = "abc";
    string re_str = "default_str";
    string match_str = "top.abcdefg123";

    // test 1
    re_str = uvm_glob_to_re(glob_str);
    temp_int = uvm_re_match(re_str,match_str);
    `uvm_info("DEBUG",
              $sformatf("temp_int: %0d, 
                        glob_str: %s, 
                        re_str: %s, 
                        match_str: %s",
                        tmp_int,glob_str,re_str,match_str),
              UVM_NONE)

    // test 2
    glob_str = "*abc*";
    re_str = uvm_glob_to_re(glob_str);
    temp_int = uvm_re_match(re_str,match_str);
    `uvm_info("DEBUG",
              $sformatf("temp_int: %0d, 
                        glob_str: %s, 
                        re_str: %s, 
                        match_str: %s",
                        tmp_int,glob_str,re_str,match_str),
              UVM_NONE)

   // test 3
    glob_str = "1234567";
    re_str = uvm_glob_to_re(glob_str);
    temp_int = uvm_re_match(re_str,match_str);
    `uvm_info("DEBUG",
              $sformatf("temp_int: %0d, 
                        glob_str: %s, 
                        re_str: %s, 
                        match_str: %s",
                        tmp_int,glob_str,re_str,match_str),
              UVM_NONE)

   // test 4
    glob_str = "*123";
    re_str = uvm_glob_to_re(glob_str);
    temp_int = uvm_re_match(re_str,match_str);
    `uvm_info("DEBUG",
              $sformatf("temp_int: %0d, 
                        glob_str: %s, 
                        re_str: %s, 
                        match_str: %s",
                        tmp_int,glob_str,re_str,match_str),
              UVM_NONE)
end
```

